ely. I hope I get a good yield!"6I hope I do even better in the contest next year!"~The yearly Berry Contest has begun here in Petalburg Town and berry enthusiasts are flocking in from all over the region!"mEveryone is trying their best to grow the most prolific Berry plant in hopes of winning the grand prize."xWe're joined by the organizer of the contest.\| Tell me, what is needed to get the best yield out of a Berry plant?"|Well, every gardener has their own set of tricks of course, but really it's all about watering your Berries diligently!"YYou heard it here first! Let's ask one of the locals what they think of the contest!"oHi there, you seem like you're a local trainer! Will this be your first time participating in the contest?"�That's great! As you can see, the Berry contest is at the height of its popularity and it attracts more and more newcomers year after year!"_Ah, a returning contestant! It looks like the competition is going to be fierce this year!"�I see, so you must be here to cheer on the participants. This event is just as much fun for spectators as it is for competitors!"ENow, what are your thoughts on this year's Berry contest so far?"XAs you can see, anyone can join this contest. Even first-timers are having a blast!"oAs you can see, participants absolutely love the contest. This is why they keep returning year after year!"MIt seems spectators might be having even more fun than the participants!"UThat's great! And I'm sure it will get even more fun as the competition goes on!"EThat's great!This must be why you're returning as a participant!"ZThis is great! You don't have to participate in the contest to have a good time here!"jThat's great! And I have no doubt that it will get more and more exciting as the competition goes on!"rGlad to hear it! It seems the contest if already off to a good start with a veteran like yourself in the mix."VI'm glad you're enjoying it so far. Feel free to look around as much as you want!"3Hopefully, it'll get more