, huh?"8I left on my own terms! Besides, that was ages ago!"uI'll cut straight to the chase we need that Pressure Regulator from the \C[1]Devon Parts\C[0] for our submarine."KWe know that \PN gave them to you after we left at the Oceanic Museum!"{You've got rocks in your head, Shelly! We don't have the parts, and if we did, why do you think we'd ever give them to you?"(\PN, get ready! This is our chance!"Humph..."ESo you really don't have those Devon Parts?... Pffft, go figure."AIt's a bit annoying... But Archie's got another plan anyway."
