. And you are?"1Oh, you're \PN, our next-door neighbour! Hi!"2We have a daughter about the same age as you."8Our daughter was excited about making a new friend."She is upstairs, I think."PLike child, like father. My husband is as wild about Pokémon as our child."KIf he's not at his lab, he's likely scrabbling about in grassy places."HOh, \V[12] went out to \C[1]Route 103\C[0] just a little while ago."@Like father, like child. \V[12] can't stay quietly at home."SHappy birthday, \PN! I came back home just for today, I just couldn't miss it."=I'm the one who picked your gift, I hope you'll like it!"$What does your rival look like?"Blow out the candles?"0\PN had a slice of cake. It's so delicious!"MBetter make sure everyone else has had a piece before going for seconds!">Oh \PN, that bandana that Dad bought for you looks great!"'So, how do you like your new room?"(Good! Everything's put away neatly!"8They finished moving everything in downstairs, too."<It really is so nice having Pokémon around to help us!"GOh, you should make sure that everything's all there on your desk."Hi, neighbor!"_My sister told me that this is what cool kids wear, so I took it from her dresser. Nyeheh!"8...But it won't fit me, so you can have it instead!"+Do you already have your own Pokémon?"hHappy birthday, \PN! \V[12] is the one who planned this entire surprise party. He was very excited!"UHappy birthday! I took the day off from the Gym for today. Challengers can wait!"*See, \PN? Isn't it nice in here, too?"cThe moving company's Pokémon even help with the unpacking and cleanup. This is so convenient!"7\PN, your room is upstairs. Go check it out, dear!"KDad even bought you a new \C[1]bandana\C[0] to celebrate the big move."3It's in your dresser. You should go try it on!"'\PN, go check out your room, dear!"<It's in your dresser upstairs. You should go try it on!"Fugiiiiih!"VHappy birthday, \PN! You've already grown a lot since you started your adventure."`My brother told me that this is wha