efore battling me, they fused together!"`Please go out and see if you can get wild Pokémon to fuse together before they battle you."NWe would need to see it happen three different times to have enough data."5Devon Corp develops all kinds of new technology!"IMy dream is to create a device that allows us to talk with Pokémon."JUnderstanding Pokémon behavior is a large part of catching Pokémon!"LStudents who don't study get a little taste of my \C[1]Quick Claw\C[0]."ZWhether or not you are a good student will be evident from the way you use this item."fA Pokémon holding the Quick Claw will occasionally speed up and get to move before its opponent."FThere are many other items that are meant to be held by Pokémon."9Just those alone will give you many topics to study."YA fusion can learn all of the moves of both its Body Pokémon and its Head Pokémon."	Mah!"(Clefairy is tapping the blackboard!"Piuh piuh!"Piuh piuh piuh!!!"0Clefairy reached out to hand you something."Piuh..."DFusions inherit the ability of either one of its base Pokémon."[I hear that Mr. Stone, the president of Devon Corp. is obsessed with Pokémon Fossils!""Heya! Do you have a PokéNav?"KI've been working on this app for it. Here, let me install it for you!"RIt's a music app! Use it to listen to your favorite tracks wherever you want!"SWhat do you think of the Jukebox App on your PokéNav? Have you been using it?"Yes"NoIu;␀�[[$"What do you want?"(Can't you see we're busy? Get lost!"!I'm working, leave me alone!"aThe beach, the fresh air... This city reminds me a lot of Cianwood City in my home region..."lI'm an adventurer from the \C[1]Johto region\C[0]. I came here while on a journey to explore the world!":Let's battle! I want to see how local trainers fight!"NWoah! You have a different style compared to the trainers where I'm from!"6Okay, I'll give you this hat from my home region!"�Actually, I have an idea! I brought way too many clothes from home and it's weighing me down, and I underestimated