st Water- and Grass-type moves..."�But Roxanne is a smart student! She knows how to fuse Pokémon to cover their weaknesses, so you have to be prepared for anything!";Take this in case your battle with her gets too tough!"~This Gym is a full on excavation site! Roxanne, the Gym Leader here, used it to unearth her powerful \V[5]-type Pokémon!"G\V[5]-type Pokémon are weak against Water and Grass type moves..."FWhoa! What a breathtaking victory!\nMy cheering must have worked."{You know, every champion needs a fitting hairstyle. I'll give you a new haircut to celebrate your victory if you want!"2Keep going! I can see great potential in you!"'I still have much to learn myself."GThe trick to becoming good at something is to never stop learning!"It's a Pokémon fossil!";Hello, I am Roxanne, the Rustboro Pokémon Gym Leader."iI became a Gym Leader so that I might apply what I learned at the Pokémon Trainer School in battle."~Pokémon League rules state that a challenger can only bring the same number of Pokémon as the Gym Leader into a battle."OI have two Pokémon on my team, so that means you can also only bring two."JWould you kindly demonstrate how you battle, and with which Pokémon?"lThe Pokémon League's rules state that Trainers are to be given this badge if they defeat a Gym Leader."<Please accept the official Pokémon League Stone Badge."SThe Stone Badge enables our Pokémon to use the HM move Cut outside of battle."$Please take this with you, too."sThat TM contains \C[1]Rock Tomb\C[0]. It not only inflicts damage by dropping rocks, but it also lowers Speed."kYou can use TMs to instantly teach a move to Pokémon, and it can be reused as many times as you like."zSince you're strong, you should challenge other Gym Leaders. By battling many trainers, you should learn many things."-And this is another little gift from me."-\C[3]\PN obtained 1 Wonder Trade ticket!"2Come back when you are ready to challenge me!"=By battling many trainers, you should learn many things.[+",也许你终究还是有机会的……"8哇！你毫不费力地突破了杜鹃的防线！"这场战斗太棒了！"#连杜鹃都被上了一课！"2不过，杜鹃还是会把你打得粉碎！";我要努力学习，这样才能像你一样战斗！"哟，怎么样了？"5听着，我的朋友！你想成为冠军吗？"A我不是训练家，但我肯定能给你获胜的建议。"P那就这么定了！我们一起朝着宝可梦锦标赛的目标前进！"这个道馆完全就是一个挖掘现场！这里的道馆馆主杜鹃用它来发掘她强大的\V[5]属性宝可梦！"=\V[5]属性的宝可梦弱水和草属性的招式……"~但杜鹃是个聪明的学生！她知道如何融合宝可梦来弥补它们的弱点，所以你必须做好万全准备！"J拿着这个，万一你和她的战斗变得太艰难就用上它！"这个道馆完全就是一个挖掘现场！这里的道馆馆主杜鹃用它来发掘她强大的\V[5]属性宝可梦！"=\V[5]属性的宝可梦弱水和草属性的招式……"M哇！多么惊心动魄的胜利！一定是我的加油起了作用。"�你知道，每个冠军都需要一个合适的发型。如果你愿意，我可以给你剪个新发型来庆祝你的胜利！"2继续加油！我看得出你潜力无限！")我自己还有很多东西要学。"8擅长某件事的诀窍就是永不停止学习！"#这是一块宝可梦化石！">你好，我是卡那兹宝可梦道馆的馆主杜鹃。"n我成为道馆馆主，是为了能将我在宝可梦训练家学校学到的东西应用到实战中。"h宝可梦联盟规定，挑战者在战斗中只能携带与道馆馆主数量相同的宝可梦。"S我的队伍里有两只宝可梦，所以这意味着你也只能带两只。"G请你展示一下你的战斗方式和所用的宝可梦好吗？"\宝可梦联盟规定，训练家如果击败道馆馆主，将被授予这枚徽章。"5请接受宝可梦联盟正式的岩石徽章。"S岩石徽章能让我们的宝可梦在战斗外使用秘传招式居合劈。"#这个也请你一并收下。"u那个技能机器里是\C[1]岩石封锁\C[0]。它不仅通过落下岩石造成伤害，还能降低速度。"q你可以用技能机器让宝可梦瞬间学会一个招式，并且可以想用多少次就用多少次。"~既然你很强大，就应该去挑战其他道馆馆主。通过与众多训练家对战，你应该能学到很多东西。",这是我给你的另一个小礼物。",\C[3]\PN获得了1张奇迹交换券！"2等你准备好挑战我的时候再来吧！"G通过与众多训练家对战，你应该能学到很多东西。;[+"*Maybe you stand a chance after all..."CWoah! You blew through Roxanne's defenses like it was nothing!"That was an awesome fight!"Even Roxanne got schooled!"'Still, Roxanne will pulverize you!":I'm going to study hard so that I can fight like you!"Yo, how's it going?">Listen, my friend! Would you like to become the Champion?"DI'm no Trainer, not me, but I can sure give you winning advice."LThat's settled, then! We'll aim for the Pokémon Championship together!"~This Gym is a full-on excavation site! Roxanne, the Gym Leader here, used it to unearth her powerful \V[5]-type Pokémon!"H\V[5]-type Pokémon are weak against Water- and Grass-type moves..."�But Roxanne is a smart student! She knows how to fuse Pokémon to cover their weaknesses, so you have to be prepared for anything!";Take this in case your battle with her gets too tough!"~This Gym is a full on excavation site! Roxanne, the Gym Leader here, used it to unearth her powerful \V[5]-type Pokémon!"G\V[5]-type Pokémon are weak against Water and Grass type moves..."FWhoa! What a br