at the bottom of the sea, making sedimentary layers.""?"By analyzing these layers, the ancient past is revealed.""?The S.S. Anne is a famous luxury cruise ship for trainers."BIt sails around the globe yearly, stopping at various cities."DWho even has that kind of money!? Just let me through, come on!":"Corsola are extremely sensitive to water pollution.""U"Areas where they gather in large reefs are an indicator of high water quality.""I want a sea Pokémon!"0I think it would feel cool and nice to hug."gA video is playing of a guy wearing a beanie conducting an experiment with some sort of machine..."�"All life is part of a complex relationship in which each is dependent upon the others, taking from, giving to and living with all the rest.""|"When Clamperl is exposed to either a Deep Sea Scale or a Deep Sea Tooth, it leaves its shell to become free swimming.""�"The Deep Sea Scale allows the pink interior part of its body to take over, while the Deep Sea Tooth makes the blue exterior grow.""6It's a research paper on deep ocean environments.">A fusion of two deep-sea Pokémon is swimming peacefully."!It's a sample of beach sand."^"Stones from mountains are washed down by rivers where they are chipped and ground down.""@"They are reduced to grains and end up as sand on beaches.""CWe were told to assemble here. I don't have a clue why though.",It's a display on the flow of seawater."n"Near the bottom of the sea, water flows due to differences in such factors as temperature and salinity.""E"Only a small percentage of oceans has been explored by humans.""v"It is estimated that there are still thousands of Pokémon species that are yet to be discovered in our oceans.""#Welcome to the Oceanic Museum."Oh, today's your birthday?"3Go right ahead, you can get in for free today!"8\GThe entrance fee is $50. Would you like to enter?"\GPlease enjoy the museum."5Oh, you're with that group that went in earlier?"FYou're the only one who's late. You'd better go catch up to them!"Please visit again!"1It's a sample of sea water with some corals."\"The sea is all connected, but the water's quality and its salinity differs by region.""|"The purity of the water around Pacifidlog Town makes it home to some of the most biodiverse coral reefs in the world.""CIf we stole the stuff in here, it would probably make us rich!"Hey! Quit listening!"J"Toward the surface, seawater flows as currents driven by the winds.""Oh! Is that a Krabby?"Look at that Magikarp!"6There's a school of Luvdisc swimming in the back!"FThat replica of the S.S. Anne alone must be worth a ton of money!"?"Water currents have a significant effect on the climate.""�"Fast moving water cools down faster which leads to colder temperatures, while a slower flow allows the water to absorb more heat.""2I get all giddy and gooey when I see the sea!"8For me, Captain Stern is the number-one role model!".A rubber ball is expanding and shrinking.">"In the sea, the weight of water itself exerts pressure.""8"In shallow water, the pressure is not very heavy.""P"However, in deep water, the pressure can reach tens of thousands of tons."">What I learn here, I can put to use on nefarious deeds..."NPeople may not like our methods, but we're working hard to save humanity."SLooking at model ships reminds me of Mr. Briney who lives near Petalburg Town."SThe ends justify the means. People will thank Team Aqua once this is all over."GI want to learn about the sea and use that knowledge for battling."%It's a replica of the S.S. Anne!"Young man..."Young woman..."Ah, \PN, is it?"DThat was quite a tense situation! Thank you for helping me out!"LWhat they were saying about this asteroid... I don't know if it's true."9It's certainly the first time I've ever heard of it."DOh, yes, I almost forgot that you brought the parts from Devon!"1\PN handed the Devon Parts to Captain Stern."dThese parts are an essential component that allows machines to operate in extreme environments.">I don't know why Team Aqua and Team Magma are after it..."yAll I know is that Devon Corp. developed it for a secret project and that they want me to test it in the deep ocean."GAnd it's an urgent matter too, so I should get to work right away!"$Thanks for this, and excuse me!"!Don't run inside the museum!""Field Moves: Dive""X"Some advanced trainers are able to use the move Dive to explore underwater areas.""r"While using the move, the Pokémon regulate their trainer's internal pressure and provide them with oxygen.""W"This Pokémon technique was used as a blueprint for the invention of submarines.""XWe came here for other reasons, but these exhibits are actually pretty interesting."IStern! Give me those Devon Parts pronto! It's for the sake of Hoenn!"(But.. These parts aren't for you..."OAnd even if they were, I don't have them. Devon hasn't delivered them yet!"... And who might you be?"DYou came to deliver the \C[1]Devon Parts\C[0] to Captain Stern?"What excellent timing!"Grunts! Grab them!"Aye, aye!"AThe boss wants the parts, so shut your yap and fork it over!"Boss, I'm soooo sorry!"	Heh!"BThat's quite a fierce expression for such a wee little scamp.""The name is \C[1]Archie\C[0]."TThe rough-looking lot you see here are members of my team, \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0]."CForgive my methods, but we need these parts you have urgently."{I can see you're not just another mindless brat, so I'll explain why exactly. Then you'll be free to make up your own mind."PYou see now, \PN? When that asteroid hits... This whole region is finished!"kDevon Corp and the Space Center want to hide it from the public... But we know how to get information!"MHah! Don't start panicking just yet. Team Aqua has thought this through!"HThere's a way to save both Pokémon and humankind at the same time!"MThere's no need to run from the disaster. All we need is to adapt to it!"GYou see \PN, humanity's greatest strength is its ability to adapt."oIt may seem drastic, but the only way for Hoenn to survive this is to embrace the changes that are coming."@<fs=36>Don't listen to one more word of this nonsense!</fs>"SThis plan is laughable at best. You Team Aqua are nothing but misguided fools."3Team Magma... Ughh... What are you doing here?"fMy team and I were on our way to Mt. Chimney when we noticed some unusual activity at the museum."VSo we stopped to investigate. And what an interesting development we stumbled on!"I am called \C[2]Maxie."fI stand at the head of \C[2]Team Magma\C[0], a noble organization which values logic and science."dIt is true that this asteroid cannot be stopped, but we do not need to abandon our way of life."TAll we need to do is prepare... So that it never reaches us in the first place."x\PN, this asteroid will change life as we know it. We must do everything to be fully prepared before it's too late."NAnd this is why we need those Devon parts right now!\. Grunts, grab them!"@Humph... I suppose this is a lot for a child to comprehend."`Tell me, \PN. What do you think is the best way to face an existential threat such as this?"This asteroid is powerful. We need to \C[2]defend \C[0]ourselves against it by putting some distance between us and the oceans."ZNo! We cannot stop nature, we need to \C[1]adapt \C[0]and learn to live alongside it."
So..."}Now you understand what I am trying to achieve with \C[2]Team Magma\C[0]. I am glad to see that I have opened your mind."WWe have set up camp just North of here. Join us there if you believe in our cause."5Humph... I'll withdraw for now and leave you be."`But know this, if you get in the way of \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0], you won't walk away unscathed."oSmart kid! Nature is too powerful to defend against it, we need to learn how to live alongside it instead."2This is what \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0] strives for."\We have a camp on \C[1]Slateport Beach\C[0]. Join us there if you believe in our cause."+Humph... I will take my leave for now."UI suggest you take care that you never again stand against \C[2]Team Magma\C[0]."%I will not be lenient if you do."&Wow! The sea Pokémon is awesome!""Field Moves: Surf""X"Trainers often use their Pokémon to ferry them across water using the move Surf.""T"The Pokémon creates waves on which it surfs to carry a trainer effortlessly.""^"Apparently, this method of traveling on the water predates even the invention of boats.""(This is ridiculous! Where's Archie?"Yes"No"I'm not sure..."Defend against it"Adapt to it[�"e水族馆里热闹非凡，到处都是无脊椎动物和色彩斑斓的小型鱼类宝可梦。")一只墨海马躲在海藻后面！"#一只大舌贝正在闲逛！"/那只千针鱼看起来对你很好奇！"R我没有50块钱，所以花了很长时间才过了接待员那一关……"#快点，别挡着排队了！" “场地招式：攀瀑”"J“有些宝可梦能使用攀瀑招式逆流而上游上瀑布。”"Y“它们以强大的爆发力在水中冲刺，借此跃升很长一段距离。”"b“经验丰富的训练家常利用这项技巧抵达其他方式难以到达的地方。”">水中漂浮着一片深海鳞片和一颗深海之牙。"\这个水箱里的爱心鱼是在被渔夫的渔网意外捕获后捐赠给我们的。"8它仍在康复中，但表现出孤独的迹象。"Y要知道，爱心鱼是非常社会化的宝可梦，需要与同类待在一起！"W我们一直在寻找一位训练家来领养和它同箱的\C[1]珍珠贝\C[0]。"c如果你能给我们带来另一只\C[1]爱心鱼\C[0]，我们很乐意把它交换给你！"D谢谢你！这只珍珠贝是在外面的港口被救起的。"~它们通常生活在更深的水域，所以需要一段时间的康复，但现在它已经准备好继续它的旅程了！"Q\C[1]爱心鱼\C[0]通常可以在博物馆外的水域通过钓鱼找到。"5爱心鱼现在有了伙伴，状态好多了！" 请尽情参观博物馆。"8这是一幅描绘城都地区愤怒湖的画作。" “场地招式：潮旋”"e“在某些区域，强烈的逆向水流相互碰撞，形成难以安全通过的漩涡。”"h“宝可梦可以使用潮旋招式制造反向漩涡，抵消它们从而实现安全通行。”",大海浩瀚无垠，深不可测……"2一定有许多我们不认识的宝可梦。"&这是一份海底土壤样本。"V“经过漫长的岁月，生物遗骸沉积在海底，形成了沉积层。”"D“通过分析这些地层，远古的过去得以揭示。”">圣特安努号是一艘著名的训练家豪华邮轮。";它每年环球航行一次，停靠在各个城市。"D谁会有那么多钱啊！？让我进去就行了，拜托！"2“太阳珊瑚对水污染极为敏感。”"P“它们聚集形成大型珊瑚礁的区域是水质优良的指标。”"&我想要一只海洋宝可梦！"/我觉得抱起来一定又凉又舒服。"M视频里一个戴着针织帽的人正在用某种机器做实验……"z“所有生命都是一个复杂关系的一部分，彼此依存，互相索取、给予，并与万物共存。”"q“当珍珠贝接触到深海鳞片或深海之牙时，它会离开外壳，变为自由游动状态。”"t“深海鳞片使其粉色的内部部分主导生长，而深海之牙则使蓝色的外部部分增长。”"5这是一篇关于深海环境的研究论文。">两只深海宝可梦的融合体正在安静地游动。"&这是一份沙滩沙子样本。"P“山上的石头被河流冲刷而下，在此过程中碎裂磨损。”"G“它们被研磨成颗粒，最终成为海滩上的沙子。”"J我们被告知在这里集合。不过我完全不知道为什么。"/这是一个关于海水流动的展示。"S“在海底附近，海水因温度和盐度等因素的差异而流动。”";“人类只探索了海洋中很小的一部分。”"S“据估计，我们的海洋中仍有数千种宝可梦尚未被发现。”")欢迎来到海洋科学博物馆。"#哦，今天是你的生日？",请进，你今天可以免费入场！"-\G入场费是50元。你要进去吗？""\G请尽情参观博物馆。"8哦，你是和之前进去的那群人一起的？"A你是唯一一个迟到的。你最好赶快跟上他们！"欢迎再次光临！"/这是一份带有珊瑚的海水样本。"D“海洋是相通的，但水质和盐度因地区而异。”"q“暮水镇周围纯净的水质使其成为世界上生物多样性最丰富的珊瑚礁家园之一。”"G如果我们把这里的东西偷走，说不定就能发财了！"嘿！别偷听了！"A“接近海面的海水以洋流的形式随风流动。”"&哦！那是一只大钳蟹吗？"看那只鲤鱼王！")后面有一群爱心鱼在游动！"G光是那个圣特安努号的复制品就一定值一大笔钱！",“洋流对气候有显著影响。”"h“流速快的水冷却更快，导致温度更低，而流速慢则使水吸收更多热量。”"8我一看到大海就头晕目眩、浑身酥软！"2对我来说，楠木馆长是第一偶像！",一个橡胶球正在膨胀和收缩。">“在海洋中，水本身的重量会产生压力。”",“在浅水中，压力并不大。”";“然而，在深水中，压力可达数万吨。”"D我在这里学到的东西，可以用在邪恶勾当上……"V人们可能不喜欢我们的手段，但我们正在为拯救人类而努力。"M看着这些船模让我想起了住在橙华市附近的哈奇老人。"\为了目的可以不择手段。等这一切结束后，人们会感谢海洋队的。"D我想了解海洋，并把那些知识运用到对战中去。")这是圣特安努号的复制品！"年轻人……"年轻姑娘……"啊，是\PN吧？";刚才真是紧张的局面！谢谢你帮我解围！"P他们说的关于这颗小行星的事……我不知道是不是真的。"/这绝对是我第一次听说这件事。"A哦，对了，我差点忘了你从得文带来的零件！"2\PN把得文的物品交给了楠木馆长。"J这些零件是让机器能在极端环境下运行的关键组件。"J我不知道为什么海洋队和熔岩队在追查这个东西……"h我只知道得文公司为了一个秘密项目开发了它，他们想让我在深海中测试。"2而且事情紧急，我得马上开工了！")谢谢你送来这个，失陪了！"#不要在博物馆里奔跑！" “场地招式：潜水”"M“一些高阶训练家能够使用潜水招式探索水下区域。”"\“使用该招式时，宝可梦会调节训练家的体内压力并提供氧气。”"A“这项宝可梦技巧被用作潜艇发明的蓝图。”"M我们来这里另有目的，但这些展品其实还挺有意思的。"A楠木！快把得文的物品给我！这是为了丰缘！"2但是……这些零件不是给你的……"M就算它们是给我的，我也没有。得文还没有送货过来！"……你又是哪位？"?你是来给楠木馆长送\C[1]得文的物品\C[0]的？"来得正是时候！" 队员们！抓住他们！"是，是！"A老大要零件，所以闭上你的嘴，乖乖交出来！"#老大，我太对不起了！"哼！"2这么个小家伙，表情还挺凶的嘛。"!我叫\C[1]水梧桐\C[0]。"N你看到的这些粗犷的家伙都是我\C[1]海洋队\C[0]的成员。"D原谅我的手段，但我们急需你手里的这些零件。"z我看得出来你不是那种没脑子的小鬼，所以我会解释清楚原因。然后你可以自己做决定。"\你现在明白了吧，\PN？当那颗小行星撞击时……整个地区就完了！"e得文公司和宇宙中心想对公众隐瞒这件事……但我们知道怎么获取情报！"8哈！先别慌。海洋队已经考虑周全了！";有一种方法可以同时拯救宝可梦和人类！"5无需逃避灾难。我们只需要适应它！";你看\PN，人类最大的优势就是适应能力。"�这看起来可能有些极端，但丰缘要想在这场灾难中幸存下来，唯一的办法就是拥抱即将到来的变化。"2<fs=36>别再听这些胡言乱语了！</fs>"k这个计划说得再好听也是可笑至极。你们海洋队不过是一群误入歧途的傻瓜。"8熔岩队……呃……你们来这里干什么？"_我和我的团队在前往烟囱山的路上注意到了博物馆的一些异常动静。"P于是我们停下来调查。结果碰巧发现了这么有趣的发展！"我叫\C[2]赤焰松。"T我领导着\C[2]熔岩队\C[0]，一个崇尚逻辑与科学的高贵组织。"_的确，这颗小行星无法被阻止，但我们不需要放弃我们的生活方式。"P我们只需要做好准备……让它从一开始就无法触及我们。"�\PN，这颗小行星将彻底改变我们所熟知的生活。我们必须竭尽全力，在为时已晚之前做好万全准备。"_这就是我们现在就需要那些得文的物品的原因！队员们，抓住他们！">哼……我想这对一个孩子来说太难理解了。"Y告诉我，\PN。你认为面对这样的生存威胁，最好的方法是什么？"l这颗小行星威力巨大。我们需要\C[2]抵御\C[0]它，拉开我们与海洋之间的距离。"Z不！我们无法阻止自然，我们需要\C[1]适应\C[0]并学会与之共存。"那么……"o现在你明白我带领\C[2]熔岩队\C[0]想要达成什么目标了。我很高兴看到你开了窍。"e我们在北边不远处扎了营。如果你认同我们的事业，就到那里来找我们。"/哼……我先撤了，不打扰你了。"W但你记住，如果你妨碍了\C[1]海洋队\C[0]，你不可能全身而退。"k聪明的孩子！自然的力量太过强大，无法抵御，我们需要学会如何与之共存。"3这就是\C[1]海洋队\C[0]奋斗的目标。"u我们在\C[1]凯那海滩\C[0]上有一个营地。如果你认同我们的事业，就到那里来找我们。" 哼……我先告辞了。"B我劝你小心点，不要再与\C[2]熔岩队\C[0]作对。"2如果你再犯，我可不会手下留情。"&哇！海洋宝可梦太棒了！" “场地招式：冲浪”"J“训练家常使用冲浪招式让宝可梦载着他们渡水。”"_“宝可梦创造出波浪，在上面冲浪，从而轻松地载着训练家前行。”"S“显然，这种水上移动方式的出现甚至早于船只的发明。”")这太荒谬了！水梧桐在哪？"是"否"我不确定……"抵御它"适应它;[�"TThe aquarium is bustling with invertebrates and small, colourful fish Pokémon.",A Horsea is hiding behind some seaweed!"&A Shellder is just hanging about!"+That Qwilfish looks curious about you!"NI didn't have $50, so it took a long time to get past the receptionist..."'Come on, stop holding up the line!""Field Moves: Waterfall""M"Some Pokémon are able to swim up waterfalls using the move Waterfall.""d"They charge through the water with powerful bursts of speed that propels up a great distance.""g"Experienced trainers often use this technique to get to places that are otherwise hard to reach.""BIt's a Deep Sea Scale and a Deep Sea Tooth floating in water."fThe Luvdisc in this tank was donated to us after it was accidentally caught in a fisherman's net."QIt's still being rehabilitated, but it's been showing signs of being lonely."\You see, Luvdisc are very social Pokémon that need to be with others of their species!"_We've been looking for a Trainer to rehome the \C[1]Clamperl\C[0] it shares its tank with."RIf you can bring us another \C[1]Luvdisc\C[0], we'll happily trade it to you!"JThank you! This Clamperl was rescued outside of here, in the harbour."�They typically live in much deeper waters so it needed to be rehabilitated for a bit, but now it's ready to continue its journey!"`\C[1]Luvdisc\C[0] can usually be found by fishing in the waters just outside of the museum."DLuvdisc has been doing much better now that it has a companion!"Please enjoy the museum."=It's a painting of the Lake of Rage in the Johto region.""Field Moves: Whirlpool""j"In some areas, strong opposing currents collide, forming whirlpools that are dangerous to traverse.""t"Pokémon can use the move Whirlpool to create inverse whirlpools that cancel them out and allow safe passage.""7The sea is vast without end and infinitely deep...":There must be many Pokémon that we don't know about."0It's a sample of soil from the ocean floor."m"Over many years, the remains of life-forms settle at the bottom of the sea, making sedimentary layers.""?"By analyzing these layers, the ancient past is revealed.""?The S.S. Anne is a famous luxury cruise ship for trainers."BIt sails around the globe yearly, stopping at various cities."DWho even has that kind of money!? Just let me through, come on!":"Corsola are extremely sensitive to water pollution.""U"Areas where they gather in large reefs are an indicator of high water quality.""I want a sea Pokémon!"0I think it would feel cool and nice to hug."gA video is playing of a guy wearing a beanie conducting an experiment with some sort of machine..."�"All life is part of a complex relationship in which each is dependent upon the others, taking from, giving to and living with all the rest.""|"When Clamperl is exposed to either a Deep Sea Scale or a Deep Sea Tooth, it leaves its shell to become free swimming.""�"The Deep Sea Scale allows the pink interior part of its body to take over, while the Deep Sea Tooth makes the blue exterior grow.""6It's a research paper on deep ocean environments.">A fusion of two deep-sea Pokémon is swimming peacefully."!It's a sample of beach sand."^"Stones from mountains are washed down by rivers where they are chipped and ground down.""@"They are reduced to grains and end up as sand on beaches.""CWe were told to assemble here. I don't have a clue why though.",It's a display on the flow of seawater."n"Near the bottom of the sea, water flows due to differences in such factors as temperature and salinity.""E"Only a small percentage of oceans has been explored by humans.""v"It is estimated that there are still thousands of Pokémon species that are yet to be discovered in our oceans.""#Welcome to the Oceanic Museum."Oh, today's your birthday?"3Go right ahead, you can get in for free today!"8\GThe entrance fee is $50. Would you like to enter?"\GPlease enjoy the museum."5Oh, you're with that group that went in earlier?"FYou're the only one who's late. You'd better go catch up to them!"Please visit again!"1It's a sample of sea water with some corals."\"The sea is all connected, but the water's quality and its salinity differs by region.""|"The purity of the water around Pacifidlog Town makes it home to some of the most biodiverse coral reefs in the world.""CIf we stole the stuff in here, it would probably make us rich!"Hey! Quit listening!"J"Toward the surface, seawater flows as currents driven by the winds.""Oh! Is that a Krabby?"Look at that Magikarp!"6There's a school of Luvdisc swimming in the back!"FThat replica of the S.S. Anne alone must be worth a ton of money!"?"Water currents have a significant effect on the climate.""�"Fast moving water cools down faster which leads to colder temperatures, while a slower flow allows the water to absorb more heat.""2I get all giddy and gooey when I see the sea!"8For me, Captain Stern is the number-one role model!".A rubber ball is expanding and shrinking.">"In the sea, the weight of water itself exerts pressure.""8"In shallow water, the pressure is not very heavy.""P"However, in deep water, the pressure can reach tens of thousands of tons."">What I learn here, I can put to use on nefarious deeds..."NPeople may not like our methods, but we're working hard to save humanity."SLooking at model ships reminds me of Mr. Briney who lives near Petalburg Town."SThe ends justify the means. People will thank Team Aqua once this is all over."GI want to learn about the sea and use that knowledge for battling."%It's a replica of the S.S. Anne!"Young man..."Young woman..."Ah, \PN, is it?"DThat was quite a tense situation! Thank you for helping me out!"LWhat they were saying about this asteroid... I don't know if it's true."9It's certainly the first time I've ever heard of it."DOh, yes, I almost forgot that you brought the parts from Devon!"1\PN handed the Devon Parts to Captain Stern."dThese parts are an essential component that allows machines to operate in extreme environments.">I don't know why Team Aqua and Team Magma are after it..."yAll I know is that Devon Corp. developed it for a secret project and that they want me to test it in the deep ocean."GAnd it's an urgent matter too, so I should get to work right away!"$Thanks for this, and excuse me!"!Don't run inside the museum!""Field Moves: Dive""X"Some advanced trainers are able to use the move Dive to explore underwater areas.""r"While using the move, the Pokémon regulate their trainer's internal pressure and provide them with oxygen.""W"This Pokémon technique was used as a blueprint for the invention of submarines.""XWe came here for other reasons, but these exhibits are actually pretty interesting."IStern! Give me those Devon Parts pronto! It's for the sake of Hoenn!"(But.. These parts aren't for you..."OAnd even if they were, I don't have them. Devon hasn't delivered them yet!"... And who might you be?"DYou came to deliver the \C[1]Devon Parts\C[0] to Captain Stern?"What excellent timing!"Grunts! Grab them!"Aye, aye!"AThe boss wants the parts, so shut your yap and fork it over!"Boss, I'm soooo sorry!"	Heh!"BThat's quite a fierce expression for such a wee little scamp.""The name is \C[1]Archie\C[0]."TThe rough-looking lot you see here are members of my team, \C[1]Team Aqua\C[0]."CForgive my methods, but we need these parts you have urgently."{I can see you're not just another mindless brat, so I'll explain why exactly. Then you'll be free to make up your own mind."PYou see now, \PN? When that asteroid hits... This whole region is finished!"kDevon Corp and the Space Center want to hide it from the public... But we know how to get information!"MHah! Don't start panicking just yet. Team Aqua has thought this through!"HThere's a way to save both Pokémon and humankind at the same time!"MThere's no need to run from the disaster. All we need is to adapt to it!"GYou see \PN, humanity's greatest strength is its ability to adapt."oIt may seem drastic, but the only way for Hoenn to survive this is to embrace the changes that are coming."@<fs=36>Don't listen to one more word of this nonsense!</fs>"SThis plan is laughable at best. You Team Aqua are nothing but misguided fools."3Team Magma... Ughh... What are you doing here?"fMy team and I were on our way to Mt. Chimney when we noticed some unusual activity at the museum."VSo we stopped to investigate. And what an interesting development we stumbled on!"I am called \C[2]Maxie."fI stand at the head of \C[2]Team Magma\C[0], a noble organization which values logic and science."dIt is true that this asteroid cannot be stopped, but we do not need to abandon our way of life."TAll we need to do is prepare... So that it never reaches us in the first place."x\PN, this asteroid will change life as we know it. We must do everything to be fully prepared before it's too late."NAnd this is why we need those Devon parts right now!\. Grunts, grab them!"@Humph... I suppose this is a lot for a child to comprehend."`Tell me, \PN. What do you think is the best way to face an existential threat such as this?"This asteroid is powerful. We need to \C[2]defend \C[0]ourselves against it by putting some distance between us and the oceans."ZNo! We cannot stop nature, we need to \C[1]adapt \C[0]and learn to