e an extra uniform in this box. Put it on and go see if some of the other grunts need help.")Huh? You're done with your training?"HWell... I guess you're officially part of Team Magma now, congrats!""That's great timing actually."�I sent one of the grunts to scout the area when we set up camp here and he said he spotted some \C[2]Slugma Eggs\C[0] not too far."uNow that things have calmed down a bit, we should go collect them. Slugma's the perfect Pokémon for us to fuse!"@I'll need a hand though, so you're coming along. Follow me!"=Listen, you gotta wear your uniform when you're on duty."+Hot as a... Slugma? Meh, I don't know."Fierce as a ... Numel?"$Ehh... Or maybe hot as a Numel?",No, we need to find something punchier!"%Oh, hey. It's the new recruit..."jTabitha tasked us with coming up with an official theme song for Team Magma. Maybe you can help us..."KIt needs to make us sound tough and intimidating. You got inspiration?"Let's get to work then!"7Yeah... I didn't expect much from a newbie anyway."+Huh? Who are you? Where's you uniform?"Can't you see we're busy?"1You're gonna help us compose the theme song?",There we have it. That's the full song!"3Oh, that's good! Maxie's gonna be proud of us!"+Alright, here's for your contribution!"You said you would!"UThere's a pile of Team Magma uniforms. It looks like they've been worn before..."%Use the \C[2]Magma Uniform\C[0]?"UThere's a pile of Team Magma uniforms. It looks like they'be been worn before..."MIt's a map of the Hoenn region. A few locations are marked with a red X."Let's go!"See ya"Yes"NoIu;␀U[["V\C[1]Before that asteroid slams into the ocean, we'll take the time to get ready."8\C[1]First, we adapt our cities to make them float!"$\C[1]Just like Pacifidlog Town!"3\C[1]Then, we'll expand the oceans themselves!"@\C[1]Everyone'll have to adapt. It'll be a new way of life!"j\C[1]When the asteroid hits, it'll be nothing but a big wave. Our aquatic cities will barely feel it!"[\C[2]The only rational solution to defend against that asteroid is to expand the land!"g\C[2]You see, by increasing the landmass, we'll create a natural barrier between us and the ocean."{\C[2]So when the asteroid strikes, the extra land will shield us from the water and our cities will be left unscathed."Z\C[1]But what about all of the Pokémon that live on land, right? Where will they go?"\C[1]Ho ho! It's simple!"e\C[1]We'll fuse them all with water Pokémon! Then they'll live in the ocean, just like we will."_\C[3]The asteroid would land in the ocean. This will release an enormous amount of energy."H\C[3]The shockwave would create massive tsunamis in all directions."`\C[3]These tsunamis would then hit all coastal cities like Slateport City at the same time!"f\C[2]Of course, this comes at a cost. Pokémon that depend on the sea will lose their habitats..."C\C[2]...Which is why we will fuse them all with land Pokémon!"$\C[2]THAT's how you save Hoenn!"b\C[11]You see, there's a huge \C[3]asteroid\C[11] that's on track to collide with our planet."\\C[11]This asteroid is more than six miles in diameter and it's coming towards us fast."O\C[11]They say it'll come slamming down in the ocean near Sootopolis City!"E\C[11]When it does, it'll unleash a terrifying amount of energy."I\C[11]The shockwave will create massive tsunamis in every direction."l\C[3]The floods would be so intense that it would wipe out entire cities, along with their inhabitants!"E\C[11]All the coastal cities like Slateport will be hit at once!"u\C[11]The floods would be so intense that it will wipe them out completely, along with everyone who lives there!["U\C[1]在那颗小行星撞击海洋之前，我们会抓紧时间做好准备。"7\C[1]首先，我们把城市改造成漂浮的！""\C[1]就像暮水镇一样！"1\C[1]然后，我们将扩展海洋本身！"L\C[1]每个人都必须适应。这将是一种全新的生活方式！"g\C[1]当小行星撞击时，不过就是一波大浪。我们的水上城市几乎感觉不到！"O\C[2]抵御那颗小行星唯一合理的解决方案就是扩张陆地！"m\C[2]你看，通过增加陆地面积，我们将在自己和海洋之间建立起一道天然屏障。"s\C[2]这样当小行星撞击时，多出来的陆地会将海水挡住，我们的城市就会安然无恙。"[\C[1]但是那些生活在陆地上的宝可梦怎么办，对吧？它们去哪儿？"\C[1]嚯嚯！很简单！"v\C[1]我们把它们全都和水属性宝可梦融合！然后它们就能像我们一样生活在海洋里了。"F\C[3]小行星会坠入海洋。这将释放出巨大的能量。"=\C[3]冲击波会向四面八方引发巨大的海啸。"R\C[3]这些海啸会同时袭击包括凯那市在内的所有沿海城市！"j\C[2]当然，这需要付出代价。依赖海洋生存的宝可梦将失去它们的栖息地……"L\C[2]……所以我们才要把它们全都和陆地宝可梦融合！"+\C[2]这才是拯救丰缘的方法！"a\C[11]你知道，有一颗巨大的\C[3]小行星\C[11]正朝着我们的星球撞过来。"M\C[11]这颗小行星直径超过六英里，正快速向我们飞来。">\C[11]据说它会猛撞进琉璃市附近的海洋里！"5\C[11]届时，它将释放出恐怖的能量。">\C[11]冲击波会向四面八方引发巨大的海啸。"C\C[3]洪水会猛烈到足以毁灭整座城市及其居民！"M\C[11]所有像凯那市这样的沿海城市都会同时遭到袭击！"V\C[11]洪水会猛烈到足以将它们连同那里的所有居民彻底抹去！;["V\C[1]Before that asteroid slams into the ocean, we'll take the time to get ready."8\C[1]First, we adapt our cities to make them float!"$\C[1]Just like Pacifidlog Town!"3\C[1]Then, we'll expand the oceans themselves!"@\C[1]Everyone'll have to adapt. It'll be a new way of life!"j\C[1]When the asteroid hits, it'll be nothing but a big wave. Our aquatic cities will barely feel it!"[\C[2]The only rational solution to defend against that asteroid is to expand the land!"g\C[2]You see, by increasing the landmass, we'll create a natural barrier between us and the ocean."{\C[2]So when the asteroid strikes, the extra land will shield us from the water and our cities will be left unscathed."Z\C[1]But what about all of the Pokémon that live on land, right? Where will they go?"\C[1]Ho ho! It's simple!"e\C[1]We'll fuse them all with water Pokémon! Then they'll live in the ocean, just like we will."_\C[3]The asteroid would land in the ocean. This will release an enormous amount of energy."H\C[3]The shockwave would create massive tsunamis in all directions."`\C[3]These tsunamis would then hit all coastal cities like Slateport City at the same time!"f\C[2]Of course, this comes at a cost. Pokémon that depend on the sea will lose their habitats..."C\C[2]...Which is why we will fuse them all with land Pokémon!"$\C[2]THAT's how you save Hoenn!"b\C[11]You see, there's a huge \C[3]asteroid\C[11] that's on track to collide with our planet."\\C[11]This asteroid is more than six miles in diameter and it's coming towards us fast."O\C[11]They say it'll come slamming down in the ocean near Sootopolis City!"E\C