zzzzz! I can still feel the shock waves from our battle!"6Or maybe it's from that electricity next to me..."Turn on the generator?"Turn off the generator?"DWattson, our Gym Leader, has been around for a long, long time."2What? You've gotten past all my rigged doors?"%Wahahahah! Now, that is amusing!"aMaking traps for my Gym and battling with young Trainers like you are the things I live for!"YNow, I, Wattson, the Leader of Mauville Gym, shall electrify you! Choose 4 Pokémon!"4I was electrified by you. Now, take this badge!"RWith the Dynamo Badge, Pokémon can use the HM Rock Smash outside of battles."GAll righty then, this here's for you too! Go on, take it with you!"KIt's a move that never misses! It'll shock your opponents to the core!"FI swell with optimism, seeing a promising young Trainer like you!".\C[3]\PN obtained 3 Wonder Trade tickets!"+Wahahaha! Come back when you're ready!"8Pokémon and rock, it's all about heart, whoa yeah!"=\C[2]This is where the current version of the game ends."�\C[2]You can continue to explore, but any content past this point, including the use of Rock Smash, will only be available in future updates."J\C[2]Please fill out this form to give us some feedback about Part 1."6The link will open automatically in your browser."a\C[2]Make sure to join the Pokémon Infinite Fusion Discord to stay up to date with updates!""\C[3]Unlocked Randomizer Mode""\C[3]Unlocked Custom Starters" \C[3]Unlocked New Game Plus"Yes"No"View Credits"Go to Discord[,"/我听说紫堇市是由铁旋创立的。"h在我们成为训练家之前很久他就是训练家了。他一定知道各种各样的事情！"8铁旋说他喜欢用开关设置一些小陷阱。",嘿，怎么样了，未来的冠军？"a铁旋是紫堇道馆的馆主。他喜欢使用\V[5]属性的融合宝可梦。嗡滋滋！"\他在他的道馆里到处安装了由开关控制的电力装置！别被电到了！"拿着这个！";哇，你太厉害了！你给门通上电打开了！";让我给你弄一个像铁旋那样的疯狂发型！" 你已经光芒四射了！">嗡嗡嗡！我还能感受到我们对战的冲击波！",或者是因为我旁边的电流……"打开发电机？"关闭发电机？"M铁旋，我们的道馆馆主，已经活跃了很长很长时间了。">什么？你已经闯过了我所有设了机关的门？")哇哈哈哈哈！这倒是有趣！"h为我的道馆设计陷阱，和像你这样年轻的训练家对战，就是我生活的意义！"`现在，我，铁旋，紫堇道馆的馆主，要给你通电了！选4只宝可梦吧！";我被你电到了。好了，收下这枚徽章吧！"V有了电力徽章，宝可梦就可以在战斗外使用秘传招式碎岩了。"8那好吧，这个也给你！拿着，带走吧！"P这是一个绝不会落空的招式！它会将你的对手彻底震慑！"P看到像你这样有前途的年轻训练家，我心中充满了乐观！",\C[3]\PN获得了3张奇迹交换券！"2哇哈哈哈！等你准备好了再来吧！"5宝可梦和摇滚，全靠一颗心，喔耶！".\C[2]这是当前版本游戏的终点。"y\C[2]你可以继续探索，但此后的任何内容，包括碎岩的使用，都将在未来的更新中提供。"J\C[2]请填写此表格，向我们提供关于第1部分的反馈。"2链接将自动在你的浏览器中打开。"b\C[2]请务必加入宝可梦无限融合Discord服务器，以便及时了解更新动态！"\C[3]解锁了随机模式"+\C[3]解锁了自定义初始宝可梦"\C[3]解锁了新游戏+"是"否"查看制作人员名单"前往Discord;[,"5I've heard that Mauville was founded by Wattson."WHe was a Trainer long before we became Trainers. He must know all sorts of things!"AWattson says he likes setting up little traps with switches."*Hey, how's it going, future champion?"YWattson is the Leader of Mauville Gym. He likes to use \V[5]-type fusions. Bzz-zzzt!"XHe's put in switch-controlled electric devices all over his Gym! Don't get shocked!"Take this!"=Whoa, you're electrifying! You've powered the door open!"3Let me give you a crazy hairdo like Wattson's!"#You're shining bright already!"@Buzzzzzz! I can still feel the shock waves from our battle!"6Or maybe it's from that electricity next to me..."Turn on the generator?"Turn off the generator?"DWattson, our Gym Leader, has been around for a long, long time."2What? You've gotten past all my rigged doors?"%Wahahahah! Now, that is amusing!"aMaking traps for my Gym and battling with young Trainers like you are the things I live for!"YNow, I, Wattson, the Leader of Mauville Gym, shall electrify you! Choose 4 Pokémon!"4I was electrified by you. Now, take this badge!"RWith the Dynamo Badge, Pokémon can use the HM Rock Smash outside of battles."GAll righty then, this here's for you too! Go on, take it with you!"KIt's a move that never misses! It'll shock your opponents to the core!"FI swell with optimism, seeing a promising young Trainer like you!".\C[3]\PN obtained 3 Wonder Trade tickets!"+Wahahaha! Come back when you're ready!"8Pokémon and rock, it's all about heart, whoa yeah!"=\C[2]This is where the current version of the game ends."�\C[2]You can continue to explore, but any content past this point, including the use of Rock Smash, will only be available in future 