 more powerful together!"pI unfused my <UNFUSED_POKEMON>.<br>I wonder what I can fuse my <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> with next!"\My <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> is way cooler now that I reversed it into a <REVERSED_POKEMON>!"BHuh? I found this next to the pond. You can have it, I guess."CHeheh, I spotted you! Now you have to take on my Bug Pokémon!"MBattle as many Trainers as you can! That's how we Trainers get stronger!"=I added a new <CAUGHT_POKEMON> to my team! Wanna see it?"hBug Pokémon change a lot when they evolve.<br>Want to see what my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> turned into?"fI know just what to do to make my team better.<br>I'll fuse my <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON>!"JMaybe my <UNFUSED_POKEMON> will be better unfused. What do you think?"WWoah, <REVERSED_POKEMON> looks way stronger than it did as a <UNREVERSED_POKEMON>!"/Hey! I caught this item in my net for you!":Do you think there's any rare Pokémon on this route?"HI'm always down for another battle! I'll beat you one day, I swear!"8I Just caught a <CAUGHT_POKEMON>! How cool is that?"WDid you know <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolves into <EVOLVED_POKEMON>?<br>Mine just did!"vMy <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> accidentally touched my last DNA Splicer and became a <FUSED_POKEMON>. Oops."|I'm going to see what else I can fuse <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> with instead of keeping them as a <UNFUSED_POKEMON>."iWhich is better, my old <UNREVERSED_POKEMON>, or this new <REVERSED_POKEMON>?<br>We'll find out now!"`There you are! I got you a little something to thank you for all these cool battles we had."XI'm going to take on the Gym Challenge and become the best Trainer in all of Hoenn!"|I need to train more if I want to take on the Gym Challenge.<br>Will you rematch me or trade me one of your strong Pokémon?"4I caught a new Pokémon! Meet <CAUGHT_POKEMON>!"^Whew, after training hard, my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> finally evolved into <EVOLVED_POKEMON>!"S<HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> joined strengths and became <FUSED_POKEMON>!"W<HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> weren't working out together, so I unfused them."F<REVERSED_POKEMON> is so much stronger than <UNREVERSED_POKEMON>!"><PLAYER_NAME>! This'll help you to become a good Trainer!"bI was having so much fun running in the sand that I accidentally scared all the Wingull away!"WAnother match, really? Do you really not mind the sand getting all over the place?"�You never know what Pokémon you'll find on the beach!<br>I tripped on a <CAUGHT_POKEMON> while running around, so I took the opportunity to catch it!"sHuff, huff...<br>If you exercise a lot, you'll grow big and strong, just like me and my new <EVOLVED_POKEMON>!"eI found a DNA Splicer washed up on the shore and I used it on <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON>!"-My <UNFUSED_POKEMON>? Nah, I unfused it."WI reversed <REVERSED_POKEMON> . What will its footsteps look like on the sand now?"WUgh, I dropped this item in the sand. I don't want it anymore, so you can have it!"]I reeled in a really cool Pokémon while fishing. It has this almost magical look to it!";Fishing is chill, I can spare some time for a rematch.">Check out this <CAUGHT_POKEMON> I reeled in this morning!"FMy Pokémon ate all my bait and evolved into a <EVOLVED_POKEMON>."�Gah, I fell asleep while fishing...<br>When I woke back up, my <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> were gone!<br>All I could find was this <FUSED_POKEMON>."�They say there's plenty of fish in the sea...<br>...and now there's plenty in my team, now that I've unfused my <UNFUSED_POKEMON>!"|I got a little bored waiting for a bite. I reversed my <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> into a <REVERSED_POKEMON> to pass the time."CA Pokémon I fished was holding this. I'd like you to have it!"yThere are so many beautiful Pokémon to be found all across the region!<br>Make sure to search the grass thoroughly!"6Would you like to see my adorable Pokémon again?"FI've met a new friend!<br>Look at this adorable <CAUGHT_POKEMON>!"FGasp! My <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON>...<br>It became a <EVOLVED_POKEMON>!"OSquee! <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> are even prettier fused together!"^Seeing <UNFUSED_POKEMON> got old, so I unfused it into <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON>."gWhat do you think of my <REVERSED_POKEMON>?<br>Much cuter than my old <UNREVERSED_POKEMON>, right?"FIt's proper etiquette to give your friends presents. Here you go!"@I caught a whole bunch of Pokémon! Behold my mighty swarm!"vAfter catching so many Pokémon, I'm all out of Poké Balls...<br>Can you trade me something better than my bugs?"AI caught a <CAUGHT_POKEMON>!<br>My swarm is even bigger now!"Having a lot of Pokémon won't help if they're puny. That's why I evolved my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> into a <EVOLVED_POKEMON>!"LHuh? Did <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> fuse when I wasn't looking?!"MI unfused my <UNFUSED_POKEMON>,so now my swarm has even more bugs in it!"C<UNREVERSED_POKEMON>... No...<br><REVERSED_POKEMON> is better!"MMy Bug Pokémon always bring me items they find in the forest. Have one!"lIt's so cool that there's Pokémon fusions in the wild! I wonder how that happens without DNA Splicers?"<I wanna see more fusions! Do you want to show me yours?"AI caught a <CAUGHT_POKEMON>! Now what should I fuse it with?"WWoah! My <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved! It should make some even cooler fusions now!"rI saw a cool <FUSED_POKEMON> the other day, so I recreated it by fusing my <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON>."{There are so many possible fusions to explore. I unfused <UNFUSED_POKEMON> so that I could test out more combinations!"fWoah, did you know that you can reverse fused Pokémon? I wonder if that happens in the wild too."5<PLAYER_NAME>! Give this to one of your fusions!"�I wanted to treat my girlfriend to a lavish gift. I came here to buy out all of the flowers in the shop, but...<br>Achoo! I'm allergic!"0Achoo! My allergies are driving me crazy..."eI found a cute <CAUGHT_POKEMON>. I'm not sure if I should keep it or give it to my girlfriend..."lDo you think that my girlfriend will like <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> better now that it's a <EVOLVED_POKEMON>?"<Achoo! I accidentally fused my Pokémon while sneezing!"|I unfused <UNFUSED_POKEMON> because my girlfriend thought it was unsettling. I can't tell if she meant the Pokémon or me..."�I have so many spare DNA Reversers, I used one on my <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> just to see what it would look like as a <REVERSED_POKEMON>."�I got this gift for my girlfriend... But on second thought, I don't know if she'll like it.<br>I suppose you could have it instead."MA strange Pokémon fusion flew in on the wind and smacked into me! Ouch!"DIt's such a breezy day! Perfect for a rematch, don't you think?"9A <CAUGHT_POKEMON> flew in on the wind! I caught it!"BWoah, <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved! Look how strong it is now."dHuh? The wind carried a DNA Splicer. I just had to use it on <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON>!"FWhoops! I accidentally unfused <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON>!"FLook how silly <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> looks now that it's reversed!"6Huh? The wind carried this to me! Do you want it?";We're twins! We do everything together, even battling!"`We need to train lots more! We usually battle each other to train, but you're way stronger?"AWe caught a <CAUGHT_POKEMON> together! We make a great team!">Mia helped me evolve <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON>. Look at it now!"OMe and my twin fused our Pokémon! Now we both share this <FUSED_POKEMON>!"DWe kept bickering over our <UNFUSED_POKEMON>, so we unfused it."�I reversed my <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> into a <REVERSED_POKEMON> because my sister said it would be better... I dunno, was she right?"9Heehee! I got you a little gift. But don't tell Mia!"7Maybe if I try without Gina... Will you battle me?"=I caught a <CAUGHT_POKEMON> all by myself, without Gina!"]My <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved! I bet Gina's gonna say it was her idea... But it wasn't!"VDon't tell Gina, but I took my sister's DNA Splicer to make this <FUSED_POKEMON>."LI unfused my <UNFUSED_POKEMON> before Gina noticed. Shhh, don't snitch!"bI turned my <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> into a <REVERSED_POKEMON> while Gina wasn't looking, hehehe!"IGina got me this gift, but you look like you need it more than I do!"PSome Pokémon live in fresh water, some live in the sea. Mine live in both."MI need to train my fish to fight out of the water! Will you help me out?"SI reeled in a new catch! Let's see if it's a keeper or if I should release it!"4Woah! My fish evolved; it's so much bigger now!"NI fused <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON>. Now they're twice as slippery!"cI unfused <UNFUSED_POKEMON>. Turns out two half-decent swimmers don't always make a great one."~I got it! My fusion wasn't working out because of the order. So, I reversed <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> into <REVERSED_POKEMON>!"1Huh? I found this in the water. Is it yours?"aIf you can't defeat us Gym Trainers, you're not worth wasting our awesome Gym Leader's time!"nSince you clearly know what you're doing, how about a battle so we Gym Trainers can learn a thing or two?"^Gym Leader Roxanne gave me a <CAUGHT_POKEMON>. I want to prove she made the right choice!"sAfter watching the Gym Leader's amazing battles, my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved! Let's see what it can do now!"]I fused my <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON>. I think they have more potential together!"�Gym Leader Roxanne said I have to master the basics, so I unfused my <UNFUSED_POKEMON>. Let's battle so I can impress my Gym Leader!"�The other Gym Trainers suggested I turn my <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> into its reverse fusion. Battle with me and tell me if my Pokémon is stronger now!"_You're so strong, you could be a Gym Trainer too! Take this gift and give it some thought."HRoxanne has a rock-solid work ethic. She was was best in her class!"sRoxanne taught me that you have to work crazy hard to see results. How about it? Let's study up with a battle!"\I caught this <CAUGHT_POKEMON>, but it's a bit lazy. Help me teach it how to work hard!"yRoxanne worked so hard on teaching me how to battle that my Pokémon evolved! Have you evolved any of your Pokémon?"kMy <HEAD_POKEMON> fused with another Pokémon! Maybe it will work twice as hard and be twice as smart!"wNow that my <UNFUSED_POKEMON> unfused, they can both work on different things. We're gonna blow the grading curve!"�My Pokémon thought that reversing would disguise it so I wouldn't make it work hard. I'm gonna have to show <REVERSED_POKEMON> what real work ethic looks like!"eYou work almost as hard as Roxanne at battling! You should have this since you practice so much."uI taught these kids everything there is to know about Rock-type Pokémon.<br>Now it's your turn to get schooled!"%Do you want another free lesson?"�One of my students gifted me this <CAUGHT_POKEMON> as a token of her appreciation.<br>If I win, will you gift me one of your Pokémon as well?"]It is not just people that evolve through learning and experience. Pokémon do the same!"bFusing two Pokémon is like two students sticking their heads together on a group assignment!"FThe group work is over. Everyone, time to work by yourself again!"�Different tasks require different skillsets.<br>That is why sometimes it makes sense to switch up who is in the role of the leader."oI have a gift for you. It's called the blessing of knowledge.<br>...<br>Okay, fine, you can have this too."ZAre you going to challenge other Gym Leaders? I can help you train for those battles."tI caught this <CAUGHT_POKEMON> while hunting for stones to research. Together, we can research battles as well."�Studying at the Trainers' School and applying what I learned to battles here let my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolve. I'll show you what happens when both Trainer and Pokémon evolve their skills."�Bringing my <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> together to evolve is like bringing together two ideas to reach understanding. I'll show you what that means."�Don't underestimate the power of strength in numbers. With the help of this DNA Splicer, I now have another rock-solid Pokémon to battle with."�If I always study with the same team, I won't learn as much about battles. I reversed my <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> to help with that."MYour battling is A+. Take this and let it motivate you to keep learning."-My Bug Pokémon are tough! Let's battle!"`One day I want to become a ninja!<br>A ninja that fights with the help of his Bug Pokémon!"9My army of Bug Pokémon keeps growing! Swarm attack!"SHahaha, my <EVOLVED_POKEMON> has grown into a perfectly ultimate great insect!"wBy themselves, Bug Pokémon are rather weak.<br>That's why I try to build a team with as many of them as possible!"*Strength in numbers! Surprise attack!"7Bet you didn't expect my classic ninja switcheroo!"cHere, this has been passed on by the ancestors of my totally legit Ninja Clan for generations."%My Pokémon rules, check it out!"$Are you here to hurt me again?!"8I got a few bruises catching this <CAUGHT_POKEMON>!"�I was standing a bit too close to my <EVOLVED_POKEMON> when it evolved.<br>Got pushed back and fell into that thorny bush over there.<br>Lesson learned."UOuch! Who thought it was a good idea to put such a pointy end on a DNA Splicer?!"_I wrapped my DNA Splicer in a paper towel, but I still managed to pierce myself with it..."0Why are the DNA Reversers so pointy?! Ouch!"@Here, take this before I find a way to hurt myself with it."'I study Pokémon fusion at school!"PI have to study harder! Will you help me learn more about Pokémon fusions?"8Today's assignment was catching a <CAUGHT_POKEMON>!"A<UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved! I'll get a good grade for sure!"GI fused my <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> for a school project!"�DNA Splicers can unsplice fusions! Wait, no... Unfuse? Um... <br>In any case, now my <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> are unfuspliced!"wFor show and tell, today, I reversed my <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> into a <REVERSED_POKEMON>!<br>Everyone was impressed!"MI made this in class yesterday and got a perfect grade! You can have it!"7It's a dead end up here. So boring! Can we battle?"4Can you tell me the way home? I'm a bit lost..."�Huh? You are wondering why I am still here?<br>Well, I was taken in by this <CAUGHT_POKEMON> and its family.<br>At first I was a bit scared, but I quickly realized that they were friendly creatures, not at all evil."WYou really don't have to worry about me, you know? Look, I even have a new friend!"VAre you hungry? My <FUSED_POKEMON> collected some berries for me.<br>I can share.">You sure keep coming back to this dead end quite a lot..."|This is still a dead end. If you want to get out of here, you need to reverse.<br>Here, let me show you how it is done."@Thank you for looking out for me. This is for your trouble."II wanted to take my son through the tunnel, but it's not finished...",A rematch? Let's make it quick, though."oMy son demanded that I catch this <CAUGHT_POKEMON>.<br>Maybe I will gift it to him once he is a bit older."Woah, my <EVOLVED_POKEMON> grew up before my son did!<br>Does that mean that I took better care of it than my I did of my son?!"�My son watched me fuse this <FUSED_POKEMON>, and now he is obsessed with the idea of fusing himself!<br>I keep telling him that humans cannot fuse, but someone told him a story of a person in the Kanto region who did just that..."`I unfused my <UNFUSED_POKEMON>.<br>Maybe my son will shut up about this fusion stuff now..."iMy son loves watching videos of Pokémon fusing and reversing on the internet, so I tried it myself.";If you ever have a child yourself, you will need this.";Bah, who needs tunnels? I'll climb OVER that mountain!"�What? You are wondering why I am still on this side of the mountain?<br>L-listen, I totally managed to climb over it by now, okay?!"[I met this <CAUGHT_POKEMON> on a hike, and we have been traveling together ever since."dHah, my <EVOLVED_POKEMON> grew up to be as tall as that mountain over there!<br>Well, almost..."|Just like how two tectonic plates fused below us to create that mountain, my <FUSED_POKEMON> fused to reach its summit!"WRivers erode mountains, even if it takes millenia. Everything must come to an end."SOnce I have climbed the tallest mountain, I will dive down the deepest trench!"4Here, I found this at the top of that mountain."COh boy, I'm late for my assignment... Help me train up, quick!"UMy assignment was to train up and evolve a Pokémon. Will you help me some more?"BI caught a <CAUGHT_POKEMON>, maybe it'll be easier to evolve!"nI did it! I evolved <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> into <EVOLVED_POKEMON>! Thanks for helping me with my assignment!"\Pokémon evolve faster when they're fused, right? No? So much for this <FUSED_POKEMON>!"KMaybe <UNFUSED_POKEMON> will evolve faster now that it's split in two!"uDoes reversing do anything for evolving Pokémon? Well anyway, <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> is now a <REVERSED_POKEMON>!"CHeheh! I took this from the teacher's office.<br>It's for you!"\We learn all sort of things at the Pokémon school. I want to test things out for real!"~Do you have some time to tutor me? I need some help on math.<br>What, you only do Pokémon battling? That's fine too, I guess."^I saw this <CAUGHT_POKEMON>, and it looked very smart! I hope that it will help me study."GWoah, <EVOLVED_POKEMON> really evolved, just like my teacher said!"|My big sister said that she discussed the ethicasies of fusing Pokémon at school.<br>But I don't know what that word means."<Maybe my <HEAD_POKEMON> becomes sad when it is fused..."^I think I messed something up when taking care of my <BODY_POKEMON> and <HEAD_POKEMON>..."�A boy from my class gave me this, but he was stuttering so much that I didn't understand what he was saying.<br>You can have it."�Feline Pokémon are simply the best. They live a life of luxury just like mine.<br>They feast, lounge around, and look beautiful doing it.".My partner Pokémon is the best there is."XI caught a stunning <CAUGHT_POKEMON>. Now it gets to live a life of luxury with us!"~Now that <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> has evolved, it's even more of itself! More comfortable, more confident, and more beautiful!"�This is a fusion with two elegant Pokémon. Together, <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> will show you just how stunning a <FUSED_POKEMON> experience can be!"eI was tired of some of the comments I was getting, so I unfused my precious <UNFUSED_POKEMON>..."HDo you know what the opposite of <FUSED_POKEMON> is? I'll show you!"uYou should take this with you so you can have a more luxurious life as well. Don't mind the Pokémon hair on it."wMy Pokémon is the rarest, most stunning, most majestic Pokémon you'll ever see!<br>It will leave you speechless!"KI'm not just doing this for my Pokémon! I'm also fighting for myself!"pI spilled my bag filled with Pokédollars earlier, and all the shiny coins attracted this <CAUGHT_POKEMON>."rI got tired of my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> being so weak, so I went to the store and bought a bunch of Rare Candy."~Did you know that Super Splicers make better fusions than regular DNA Splicers?<br>You need to be able to afford them, though."�If you keep fusing and unfusing, you're gonna run out of DNA Splicers quickly.<br>Not that it matters for someone as rich as me."�What is the opposite of being rich?<br>Oh no, no, no, I don't even want to think about such a thing!<br>Let me turn my <FUSED_POKEMON> into its opposite instead!"LTake this. My bag is so stuffed with Full Restores that it doesn't fit."XMy buddy brought me these rocks!<br>I just have to show them to you... In a battle!"MI haven't shown off my Rock Pokémon's full potential!<br>Let's rematch!"uMy buddy came back with some more mountain Pokémon for me to try.<br>Want to see my <CAUGHT_POKEMON> in action?"While I wasn't looking, my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved into <EVOLVED_POKEMON>!<br>My buddy is never going to believe this!"sMy buddy told me I should try fusing <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON>...<br>Let's see how strong they became!"wThe more Pokémon the better, so I told my buddy to unfuse <UNFUSED_POKEMON>!<br>Hopefully my intuition was right!"dMy buddy wanted me to reverse <UNREVERSED_POKEMON>!<br><REVERSED_POKEMON> looks ready to fight!"MMy buddy wanted to give you this, as thanks for fighting their Pokémon!"Check out my gnarly catch!"[If you can't find the Pokémon you're looking for while fishing, try a different spot."BWant to see my newest catch? I'll even allow you to fight it."sThe bigger fish are hard to get out of the water.<br>That's why I catch the small ones and then raise them up."]Fusing Pokémon is like catching two birds with one stone. Or... two fish with one hook?"�My wife laughed at me when I came home with only one catch.<br>But the look on her face when I turned it into two before her eyes was priceless!"7With my <REVERSED_POKEMON>, I will get a cool win!"`Sometimes you fish up the weirdest stuff. Can you believe that I had this thing on my hook?"/I can't keep these Wingull off of my fish!"YLet's have a- Agh! Pleh! I got feathers in my mouth!<br>You know what I mean, right?">Maybe the Wingull won't bother my new <CAUGHT_POKEMON>..."bEver since my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved, the Wingull have been pestering us more than ever!"hOop! That Wingull knocked my DNA Splicer away! Wait, did my <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> fuse?"�Maybe the Wingull are doing this because my Pokémon are fused. I'll try unfusing my <UNFUSED_POKEMON> and see if that helps at all..."NMaybe if I reverse my Pokémon, the Wingull won't recognize them anymore."�AAHKYAW! Oh, I've been around these Wingull so much that even my sneezes are starting to sound like them.<br>Here, maybe if you take this, they'll follow you and leave me alone." Brawn over brains! Hiyiahh!"5Hiyiahh! My head keeps spinning! Is that normal?"bMy motto is 'Don't think and just do!'<br>When I saw this <CAUGHT_POKEMON>, I just caught it."mMy <EVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved!<br>This wouldn't have been possible if we had wasted time overthinking it!"MI fused my Pokémon.<br>Why did I do it? Dunno, I didn't think about it."OI unfused my Pokémon.<br>Why did I do it? Dunno, I didn't think about it."NI reversed my fusion.<br>Why did I do it? Dunno, I didn't think about it."FDon't think. Just take it.<br>Hiyiahh! In the name of friendship!".To hone the body, you must hone the mind!"IMy Pokémon might be blind, but that just enhances its other senses!"7My new <CAUGHT_POKEMON> is ready to train with me!"WYeeeha! My <EVOLVED_POKEMON> got so much stronger after honing both body and mind!"MDo you think combining two Pokémon also doubles the size of their mind?"hTo gain strength, you need to grow in numbers.<br>That is one of the drawbacks of Pokémon fusions."VMaybe my <REVERSED_POKEMON> can see better now that <HEAD_POKEMON> took the helm."`This is my favorite item. But by giving it to you, I will strengthen my mind and willpower."3So you think you can take this sea dog on, eh?"{Did you know that some rodent Pokémon can swim across the ocean?<br>I think that's how they populated some of the islands."WThis <CAUGHT_POKEMON> looked lost as it drifted across the ocean, so I took it in."\If my <EVOLVED_POKEMON> keeps growing like this, it will soon rule over the seven seas!"The place where two oceans meet is called a marine convergence zone.<br>Allow me to show you my Pokémon convergence zone!"wSometimes the ocean currents make you drift apart.<br>My <UNFUSED_POKEMON> were hit by one such current, it seems."SThe ebb and flow... Two total opposites...<br>Just like my <REVERSED_POKEMON>."FI found this at the beach earlier. I wonder who it belonged to..."$A-ha, watch out for my pincers!"+My pincers are still ready for battle!"6I caught a <CAUGHT_POKEMON>! It'll do in a pinch!"KA-ha! My <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved! Now we can defeat you chop-chop!"bI pinched my <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> together to discover a new species for battle!"bNow that my <UNFUSED_POKEMON> has come apart, we can use the ultimate pincer maneuver on you!"@My Pokémon pinched a DNA Reverser from me! Now look at it!"hAlways take advice with a pinch of salt.<br>What? You don't want any salt? Fine, take this instead."+You're disturbing my training session!"RMeditation is also a type of training.<br>Want me to show you how it is done?"fWhile I was meditating, a <CAUGHT_POKEMON> came by and joined me.<br>Now it is always by my side."jMy <EVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved while we were meditating.<br>I only noticed when I opened my eyes again."�Someone threw a DNA Splicer at my <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> while we were meditating...<br>I bet it was Brawly... He always tries to mess with us during our training."}To master meditation means to master adaptability. That's why I decided to unfuse my Pokémon and give them a challenge."|To master meditation means to master adaptability. That's why I decided to reverse my fusion and give them a challenge."[Ah, my meditation partner!<br>I have a present for you, as a token of my appreciation."*Fighting type strongest! It is known!"/Training make muscles bigger. It is known."/New partner is like new fist. It is known."6Evolved partner is like bigger fist. It is known."4Fused partner is like double fist. It is known."4Unfused partner is like two fists. It is known."<Reversed partner is like using other fist. It is known."#Thing is known. Here is thing."3Do you want to train with me before you go on?"�Last time I went surfing, I wiped out next to this <CAUGHT_POKEMON>. It seemed pretty eager to fight, so I took it onto my team!"]My Pokémon evolved, and its strength is totally gnarly! Let's see if you can beat this!"cThis is a mondo strong fusion. My <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> fused after training hard!"�I discovered the secret of true power by staring at a Helix Fossil for days and days... I unfused my <UNFUSED_POKEMON> so we could have more eyes on it at a time."�I took my Pokémon surfing, and we did a tubular kickflip together. When we got back on shore, I saw that my <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> had reversed!<br>Did someone drop a DNA Reverser in the water?"�I kept this from my old training sessions in Kanto with a good friend of mine there. I think you'll make better use of it, though."JI've laid anchor in ports around the world, but Slateport's the best."=In the best port was the best Trainer. No surprise here!"~I've sailed around the world, but the <CAUGHT_POKEMON> around Slateport City are something else. I just had to catch one!"yIt's so easy to evolve Pokémon while you're in Slateport City. I think it's the sea air that does it. Check it out!"~Ah! One of the best thing about travelling is fusing your Pokémon with some of the local ones. Like I just did, check it out!"�After traveling to many ports, I've learned that sometimes a fusion works better in one place than other. <UNFUSED_POKEMON> will be better unfused."�You gotta be prepared for anything when you sail the seas! Always keep a DNA Reverser handy to reverse Pokémon when you need to."T<PLAYER_NAME>! I brought this back from my travels. I think you should have it!"%I'm thirsty, give me a Soda Pop!"AHow about if I beat you in a rematch, you owe me a Soda Pop!"WI caught a <CAUGHT_POKEMON> all by myself! You gotta give IT a Soda Pop, too, now!"UWoohoo! <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved! You should give me a Soda Pop to celebrate!"gOkay.. Will you finally give me that Soda Pop if I fuse two of my Pokémon?<br>No? Well, too late!"`Fine... If you won't give me a Soda Pop, then I'll unfuse <UNFUSED_POKEMON>. That's on you!"`Here, <UNREVERSED_POKEMON>. Have a sip of Soda Pop...<br>Oh, snap! That was a DNA Reverser!"[Let's do a trade! I'll give you this if you promise to give me a Soda Pop in exchange!"%Urrrrpppp...<br>Battle? With me?"}I'm usually stronger than this! I was just seasick as a dog!<br>I'm feeling a bit better now though, so what do you say?"aUrrrpp... I found a <CAUGHT_POKEMON> washed up earlier... Thought it was seashells at first."IUrghh... <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved to keep me safe while I'm sick."fUrrppp... Do you think it would help me feel better if I fused <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON>?"aDid <UNFUSED_POKEMON> unfuse? Urghh.. I'm so sick that I can't keep up with my own Pokémon."QUrrpp... Is it my head spinning, or did <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> reverse itself?"hUrppp... I found this on the beach, but I can't stand looking at it while I'm sick. Please take it!"2Doesn't an umbrella look like a giant flower?"`When I have an inner tube, me and my Pokémon's cuteness goes way up! I'll prove it to you!"JLook at this <CAUGHT_POKEMON> I caught! I should get it its own tube!"PUh-oh! <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> is gonna need a bigger tube now that it evolved!"y<HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> both wanted to go on the same tube.<br>They fused together so that they would fit!"5<UNFUSED_POKEMON> fell off its tube and unfused!"|Woops! <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> flipped its tube upside down while playing in the waves! Looks like the fusion flipped too!"8Mommy gave me this... But I don't want it, take it!"JWe're going to get all the sand from the beach and make a big castle!"IWe'll be the king and queen of the castle, but you can be a servant."EI found another servant for our castle! It's a <CAUGHT_POKEMON>!"^Woah! <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved!<br>It's no longer a servant, now it's royalty like me!">Servant, look at this! Two of my Pokémon fused together!"JWe need more servants for the castle! Let's unfuse <UNFUSED_POKEMON>!"RI commanded <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> to reverse itself! Royal servants must obey!"OYou've been a loyal servant to the king and I. You deserve a royal reward!"MThe castle keeps getting destroyed by the waves! It's never-ending work!"_It's okay if the castle gets taken by the waves; building the castle is the most fun part!"IHuh? There was a <CAUGHT_POKEMON> inside the castle this whole time!"^Our sandcastle is taking so long to make that <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> had the time to evolve!"`Maybe if I fuse <Head_POKEMON> with <BODY_POKEMON>, it'll be better at guarding the castle."VI need more guards for the castle!<br>I know, I'll just unfuse <UNFUSED_POKEMON>!"TI reversed <FUSED_POKEMON>, but now it's guarding the wrong side of the castle!"<Hey! I found this inside the castle... You can have it!"DHey! Hey, hey, hey! What's the deal? Are you after my Soda Pop?"CI'm always up for another fight, sailor! Want to give it a go?"^I gave <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> a sip of my Soda Pop and it evolved! Coincidence? I think not!"EI fused my Pokémon, and now I'm ready to head out to sea again!"I<UNFUSED_POKEMON> is now unfused. Two crewmates are better than one!"c<UNREVERSED_POKEMON> drank too many Soda Pops and got confused. Now it's a <REVERSED_POKEMON>!"5Here, sailor! This is no Soda Pop, but it'll do!"&Ahh, Soda Pops are so refreshing!">Another battle? Sure, just let me take a quick sip first!"h<CAUGHT_POKEMON> joined my team! It must've been attracted by all the Soda Pops I've been drinking!"ROh? <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved? It must be because of the the fresh sea air!"bIsn't it neat? I fused <HEAD_POKEMON> with <BODY_POKEMON>. It's like mixing Soda Pop flavors!"h<UNFUSED_POKEMON> wanted more Soda Pop, so it unfused itself to get a second drink. That trickster!"DUh? Didn't <REVERSED_POKEMON> use to be a <UNREVERSED_POKEMON>?"SI tried buying a Soda Pop from the vending machine, but this came out instead!"1I got a Soda Pop for me and for my Pokémon!"2Let's fight again! But don't cry if you lose.";I went out and caught a <CAUGHT_POKEMON> on the beach!".Woah! <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> is so big now!!"?My Pokémon are best friends now, so they decided to fuse!"9Sniff.. I didn't mean to unfuse <UNFUSED_POKEMON>..."IHeehee, I made my Pokémon switch places! They look silly like that!"E<PLAYER_NAME>! I've been saving up so that I could get you this."9Did you feel the tug of our soul-soothing fragrance?".Aromatherapy can heal your body and mind."sThe scent of a new Pokémon always brings a fresh harmony to the air.<br>Would you like to meet my new friend?"?Ah! <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON>'s aroma has blossomed beautifully!"]When two Pokémon blend into one, their fragrances intertwine into something enchanting."NUnfused again, <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> release distinct aromas."PA reversed fusion shifts the bouquet entirely—unexpected, yet delightful."YEvery item has its own distinct smell. The fragrance of this one is quite exquisite!"DI'm Amy. And this is my big sister, Liv.<br>We battle together!"KThe two of us together make one! We're better when we battle together!"WLiv caught a <CAUGHT_POKEMON> and gave it to me! That's why she's the best sister!",Look, Liv! <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> grew up!"b<HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> fused together. Now they'll be in sync just like Liv and I!"R<HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> don't need to be fused to be in sync! Look!"TReversing a fusion changed everything. Liv says it's like a whole new strategy!"XI found this for you. Liv wanted to keep it for us, but I think you should have it!"GI'm Liv. And this is my little sister, Amy.<br>We battle together!".If I could fuse with my sister, I would!!"UI caught a <CAUGHT_POKEMON>. Now, I just need to find another one for my sister.",Look, Amy! <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> grew up!"ZAmy likes to fuse Pokémon, so I did the same with <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON>!"BUh-oh! <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> are out of sync now!"EReversing fusions? It's like a mirror battle! Amy and I love it!"XI found this for you. Amy wanted to keep it for us, but I think you should have it!"JMy Pokémon is delightfully adorable!<br>Don't be shy, I'll show you!"KYou simply gotta come out and look in on my delightful Pokémon again!"|I came across a delightful <CAUGHT_POKEMON>!<br>It might be even more adorable than my other Pokémon. Just look at it!"9Oh, my! <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved! How delightful!"�Do you think that <HEAD_POKEMON> would be even more delightful if it were fused with <BODY_POKEMON>? There's only one way to find out!"No! <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> are simply too delightful to be combined together. They're more adorable separately."lI figured out how to make <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> even more delightful. All I had to do was to reverse it!"JI found this adooooorable item. I thought of you as soon as I saw it!"LGah! My fishing line's all snarled up! I'm getting frustrated and mean!"+Gah, I'm still boiling mad... Grrr...."UAughhh!! I got attacked by a <CAUGHT_POKEMON> while I was trying to fix my line!"IGahhh! My <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved... I don't have time for this!"AGahhh! <BODY_POKEMON> and <HEAD_POKEMON> got tangled up too!"fOkay... I untangled <BODY_POKEMON> and <HEAD_POKEMON>... Now to do the same with my fishing line."_Aughh... I tried to untangle <UNREVERSED_POKEMON>, but it's even more tangled than before!"7Arghh! This got stuck in my fishing line. Take it!")Did my guitar's wailing draw you in?"8My one-man show is ruined. I need to practice more!"7I got a new member in my band, wanna check us out?"NWoah! My <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved! What kind of tunes can it play now?"QI fused <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON>. They'll be my new rhythm section!"XCheck this out, <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> can play even more notes unfused!"EMy Pokémon swapped instruments... We'll have a whole new sound!";I found this while I was rocking out. You can have it!"Hahah! Sneak attack!"MYou gotta make sure you're prepared if you're gonna sneak up on someone."/Woah! A <CAUGHT_POKEMON> sneaked up on me!":Woah! One of my Pokémon just evolved out of nowhere!"7Hahah! I sneaked up on my Pokémon and fused them!"@Hahah! I sneaked up on my <UNFUSED_POKEMON> and unfused it!"BWoah! My Pokémon reversed themselves while I wasn't looking!"2Woah! This item came out of nowhere! Take it!"=Ahahaha! Fusing two cute Pokémon makes them even cuter!">My Pokémon became even cuter. Allow me to show them off."OTake a look at my newest cutie! But be warned, it packs quite a punch too!"kMost Pokémon lose some of their cuteness when they evolve.<br>Not the case with my <EVOLVED_POKEMON>!"UI experimented with more fusions in the name of cuteness.<br>This is the result!"{I have realized that cuteness is related to simpleness.<br>That is why I have decided to unfuse my <UNFUSED_POKEMON> again."^Maybe the other way around is cuter? Hmm...<br>I need a second opinion here. Help me out."[My adorable Pokémon found this for me.<br>But I already have one, so you can have it."KDon't listen to this lady over there! Unfused Pokémon are the cutest!"/Do you want to see my cute Pokémon again?"]I ran into a Pokémon in the tall grass, and it was so cute that I just had to catch it!"IOh, wow, I had no idea that my <EVOLVED_POKEMON> was able to evolve!"MAlright, alright. I gave in. I decided to try this fusion thing as well."YIn the end, nothing can convince me that my Pokémon aren't cute enough as they are."ZOops, I wanted to unfuse my <HEAD_POKEMON>, but I accidentally bought a DNA Reverser."�Sharing purifies your character, and a pure character is essential for something to be cute.<br>N-no, I didn't just make that up!"?I found some cool Pokémon in the grass around here! Look!"]Being cool also means never giving up!<br>My Pokémon are ready to go again! Rematch me!"\This <CAUGHT_POKEMON> I caught is just the coolest!<br>I'll prove it to you in a fight!"YMy <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved!<br>I couldn't believe they could become even cooler!"~Fusing two cool Pokémon together will surely make a super cool Pokémon!<br>Let me show off what <FUSED_POKEMON> can do!"XSometimes unfused Pokémon are cooler; that's why I unfused my <UNFUSED_POKEMON>..."`I tried using this DNA Reverser a friend gave to me, and now my Pokémon looks even cooler!"AThanks for showing me so many cool fusions! Here, have this!"iI have been waiting for you, <PLAYER_NAME>.<br>How do I know your name? He he he... Little secret..."�Ah, it's you. Erm... I forgot you name.<br>Can you show me your Trainer card again?<br>What, only if I can beat you in battle?<br>Fine... bring it on!"�He he he... I heard that my new <CAUGHT_POKEMON> has the power to read your mind!<br>With its help, I will find out what your name is!"MThe offer still stands, right? If I can win, you will tell me your name!"[I spent my last Pokédollar on this DNA Splicer.<br>I better be able to win this time!"QI'm really getting desperate here.<br>If only I had actual psychic powers..."o<PLAYER_NAME>! It was totally <PLAYER_NAME>!<br>I finally remembered! Let's celebrate with another battle!"GHere, will you show me your Trainer card again if I give you this?"3Up... Down... My bobber is the key to victory."IFishing is all about concentration. You have to focus on the bobber."@My bobber took the plunge! Now I've got a <CAUGHT_POKEMON>!"KI thought my Pokémon went down, but it bobbed back up with Evolution!"lI fused my Pokémon while fishing. I wasn't really looking, though, so I don't know which ones I fused."�My Pokémon wouldn't stop pestering me while I was trying to keep my eye on the bobber. I unfused it in the hopes that it would stop."qIn honor of my new bobber, I reversed my <UNREVERSED_POKEMON>. Do you think it looks more like a bobber now?"oI have the grandest gift I can give you: A bobber!<br>You seem disappointed. All right, take this instead."\Prepare yourself; now you stand underneath the spotlight of my Pokémon's magnificence!"ZHere we are again, Trainers and Pokémon positioned near my Pokémon's natural glory!"LNewly caught, let my <CAUGHT_POKEMON>'s debut be brilliantly glamorous!"UForever evolved, my <EVOLVED_POKEMON> shall glisten radiantly with new elegance!"NNow combined, you will bask in the shine of my Pokémon's reformed grace!"HUnfused, my Pokémon's natural beauty will shine onward henceforth!"JWith order twisted, a new sense of sophistication will shine through!"DA gift, for the one who enables my Pokémon's shimmering charm!".How far up can you throw your Poké Ball?"FI'm still looking for my Pokémon that was stolen by that bird..."^I miss my <CAUGHT_POKEMON> so much that I caught a new one, but it's just not the same..."I must grow stronger, so that I am able to take revenge on that stealing bird Pokémon, if it ever dares to show up here again!"\I need to know how good my new fusion is against bird Pokémon.<br>Can you help me out?"YI plan to use my <UNFUSED_POKEMON> as bait, to lure out that stealing bird Pokémon!"�What is this?! Something is in my other pocket!<br>Did I never lose that Poké Ball at all?!<br>...<br>No... That's just a DNA Reverser..."eCan you do me a favor?<br>If you ever see that stealing bird Pokémon, can you throw this at it?"Too doo doot! Here we go!"/My gears are oiled up and ready to rotate!"DDo you want another match? Okay, but only muscle power allowed!"gThis <CAUGHT_POKEMON> outran me on my bike!<br>I was so impressed that I asked it to join my team."SOh no, my <EVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved, and now it no longer fits into my bike..."mThere isn't much room to carry things on a bike.<br>That's why you have to cut weight wherever possible."gMy <UNFUSED_POKEMON> and I were eating protein bars, but it accidentally bit into a DNA Splicer..." It's time to reverse gears!":Can you hold onto this for me? It's weighing me down."fI feel bad for humans that are like you. You don't have the special powers that we Psychics have!"TIf we practice together, perhaps I can cultivate special powers in you as well."~When I reached out into the realm of thoughts, <CAUGHT_POKEMON> responded. We found each other and are stronger together."qMy <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved. Clearly this is because of the special powers we've wielded in our training!"}The memories of my <HEAD_POKEMON>... The memories of my <BODY_POKEMON>...<br>They have come together to create something new!"�I unfused my <UNFUSED_POKEMON> so that I could read the thoughts of each of its halves separately.<br>Using my special powers, I've gained a greater understanding of my Pokémon!"�Using my special powers, I read your thoughts. You wanted a different sort of battle. That's why I reversed my <UNREVERSED_POKEMON>!"mI sense you have made progress in your training. No, don't say anything. Thoughts are enough. Take this."/Swim, cycle, run. I call it the SCR-Cycle!"=What does ERS stand for? Eat, relieve, sleep, of course!"PGrab, throw, catch. I used this GTC-Cycle to capture my newest team member!"/Learn, grow, evolve. That's the LGE-Cycle.",Buy, touch, splice. It's the BTS-Cycle."iChange mind, touch, unsplice. If you want to unfuse your Pokémon, you need to follow the CTU-Cycle."aToday is a weird day. Instead of following the ERS-Cycle, I accidentally did an SRE-Cycle..."RI like coming up with names. Here, you can have this 'Unique Utility Device'."<I will run you over until you are flat like a Stunfisk!"7Sorry, sometimes I say nasty things when I lose..."`I threw a Poké Ball at a wild <CAUGHT_POKEMON> with so much force that it got knocked out."jI was angry and got into a brawl with my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON>, but then it evolved and knocked me out!"aMy <HEAD_POKEMON> and >BODY_POKEMON> didn't get along, so I fused them together. He he he..."MThe best part about love is the pain when you inevitably get torn apart!"�Fine, I'll tell you the truth.<br>When I was young, I stepped onto my Stunfisk. Totally flattened the thing.<br>It was never the same afterwards."l'I want to apologize about some of the things I said earlier.<br>Here, I hope this will make up for it."WDon't panic if your bike's going fast!<br>But do panic when the brakes don't work!"<We triathletes help each other out. How can I help you?"PA <CAUGHT_POKEMON> is the perfect partner for a triathlon, don't you agree?"5Look at the strong legs of my <EVOLVED_POKEMON>!";My <FUSED_POKEMON> can dive for five minutes straight!"=<UNFUSED_POKEMON> carries my water bottles while I race!"cAre your Pokémon faster than mine?<br>Let me warn you, I have optimized the speed of my team!"2Never go on a triathlon without one of these!"6It's time to reveal my secret power! Second gear!"'Bring it on! I use my fourth gear!"FMy crew is getting bigger. All that is missing now is a musician."IFufufu, I went through a timeskip since the last time you were here!"@Look at my secret technique! Pokémon Docking: Big Emperor!";I lost my <UNFUSED_POKEMON>, but I still have my crew!"?Fufufu, check out my new secret power! Gear negative five!"3This is my treasure, but I'll let you hold it."<Woah! Watch it! I guess you're not used to bike racing."aBike racing can be dangerous. Make sure you're using your brakes before you battle me again."oThis <CAUGHT_POKEMON> totally crashed into my bike earlier. It's much safer for it to be in my Poké Ball!"tMy Pokémon evolved with a blinding flash of light during my last race! I swear, that's the only reason I lost!"xWhen my brakes failed, my DNA Splicer went flying out of my pocket! <BODY_POKEMON> doesn't look the same anymore..."�I unfused my <UNFUSED_POKEMON> so I could have more competitors to race against. Do you know anyone who can tailor helmets to fit Pokémon?"\I tried to turn too sharply and got turned around. My Pokémon seems turned around too!"rYikes! Watch where you're going with that bike! Oh, I dropped that at your feet, but I guess you can keep it."HI'll hack and slash my way to victory with the Cut we just learned!""Just who is the Trick Master?"4I wandered into this weird house by accident..."@Shine your light through the window to figure out the code!":Ohoho! I'm the one who's been turning off your light!"9Concentrate on getting the win. That's how I battle!"#I'm concentrating on training."RI concentrated on catching a Pokémon. That's how I found a <CAUGHT_POKEMON>!"dAfter all of our training, my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved. We're not done training yet, though!"pI fused my <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> using the sheer power of my focus!<br>Also, with DNA Splicers!"�After deep concentration, I realized that having more Pokémon on my team will help me win. That's why I unfused <UNFUSED_POKEMON>!"\Before you use DNA Reversers, you have to concentrate. Concentrate on the ideal fusion!"�You've been a good sparring partner! I wanted to get you a gift, so after concentrating my energy on deciding, I chose this for you!">Isn't it nice? To battle while looking at pretty flowers?"}I like triathlons because you get to see different scenery while competing. It's just like Pokémon battles in that way!"lThis cute Pokémon started running beside me while I was heading through the meadow. We're friends now!"�My Pokémon's Evolution was even more stunning with all the flower petals blowing around! Actually, it was sort of an intense experience."�While we were running through the flowers, my <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> ran away from me. I miss them very much, but at least I met this <FUSED_POKEMON> shortly after!"zI unfused my Pokémon to take some pictures of them in the flowers. I'll probably fuse them back again after our run."�I used to come out and run through the flowers with my favorite Pokémon all the time when I was younger. Reversing my <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> reminded me of that."}I made you a flower crown, but wildflowers wilt so quickly. Perhaps this can make up for your original present falling apart."RI locked eyes with the Trainer. We both knew that fierce battle was our fate."�The mysterious Trainer approached me, their feet scuffing quietly on the ground. Why did they seek me out? A skirmish? A parley?"�<CAUGHT_POKEMON>'s spirit burned fiercely as it took its place by my side. Now that we had joined forces, no foe could stand in our way."�A dazzling light! My eyes watered both from the sight of it and from emotion. My dear partner, <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON>, had evolved at last."�All the challenges that <HEAD_POKEMON> had faced... Every triumph that <BODY_POKEMON> had won...<br>They stood combined before me, ready to claim honor on the battlefield once more."pI had forgotten where I came from! I knew what I had to do. With trembling hands, I held the DNA Splicer..."iA reversal of fate. An ending undone? With my Pokémon's fusion changed, I had a new road before me."�The melodious whizz of my bag's zipper opening preceded the gift's appearance.<br>"I want you to have this," I said to the Trainer."OThis underclassman wants to study or something, but I just want to battle!"{As an upperclassman, I have to set an excellent example.<br>So, can you at least make me look good by losing a battle?"}I caught this <CAUGHT_POKEMON> while Anna was messing around. Don't worry, I'm still keeping an eye on my underclassman!"cNow that <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved, it needs to set a good example for the rest of the team."|I fused my <HEAD_POKEMON> to show this underclassman how to fuse Pokémon. I don't think she was paying attention, though..."�My Pokémon got into my items and unfused when I wasn't looking! How am I supposed to deal with this and my underclassman at the same time?"|I'm supposed to write my report on fusing Pokémon, but I accidentally grabbed a DNA Reverser instead of a DNA Splicer!"Battling with you has been a lot more fun than studying for my language arts class. If I give you this, will you come by again?"jThe Pokéathlon came through here recently! I've got to train hard to not let my team down next year!"Let's... Pokéathlon!"HI celebrated the Pokéathlon by adding another Pokémon to my team!"gMy <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved! Do you think that will get us more points in the next Pokéathlon?"lPokéathletes these days are all about fusion! I fused my Pokémon so I can keep up with everyone else!"�I unfused my Pokémon so I can be my own team!<br>Ruby, Sapphire, and Emerald are already taken for names, so maybe <HEAD_POKEMON>, <BODY_POKEMON>, and I will be Team Topaz."�I heard they're planning on building a dome just for the Pokéathlon over in Johto. I reversed my <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> so we can be ready for when it opens."{I'd share my Aprijuice with you, but I need it to train my Pokémon for the Pokéathlon. You can take this instead, though!"|I have so many Pokémon to take care of that I ran out of space!<br>That's why I decided to fuse some of them together!"bMy Pokémon were inspired to become stronger after fighting you!<br>Wanna see their progress?"cGood to see you again. I have bred even more Pokémon.<br>Can you help me with their training?"BMy little ones are growing up so fast! Here, let me show you!"wI'm running out of space on my team again, so I did some more fusing.<br>I hope my little ones aren't mad at me..."~My <UNFUSED_POKEMON> wasn't very happy about being fused.<br>As a parental figure, sometimes you have to accept your mistakes."Have you ever tried reversing your fusions?<br>Who knows, doing that might just be the key to unlock their full potential!"XI have a little something for you, as a thanks for helping me raise my little ones."VI do my triathlon training with Pokémon, so I'm pretty confident about my speed."PYou appear to be training properly... If you'd like, I'll battle you again!"VI caught this <CAUGHT_POKEMON> by running after it! It was no match for my speed!"nNow that my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved, I wonder if I'll be able to keep pace with it during training..."�It's hard to focus on training multiple Pokémon while I'm trying to train myself for the next triathlon. It's easier plan our practices now that they're fused into <FUSED_POKEMON>!"�I wasn't sure if my Pokémon was fast because of its <HEAD_POKEMON> side or its <BODY_POKEMON> side. Now that I've unfused it, we can find out!"}Different shapes of Pokémon are better in different kinds of terrain. I reversed my Pokémon so we can go run in new places."�If you beat me in a game of tag, I'll give you a reward!<br>...<br>I didn't say to start yet. Oh well, I guess you win. Go ahead and take this."Bug types!"lI was once a Bug Catcher, and now I'm a Bug Maniac!<br>However, my love for Pokémon remains unchanged!"}I used my years of experience catching Bug-type Pokémon to help me find this <CAUGHT_POKEMON>. Go, my <CAUGHT_POKEMON>!"qMy Pokémon has evolved, just as I have! Even if we seem different, I'll prove we're the same on the inside!"^Fusion can lead to growth. My Bug-type Pokémon and I-<br>Wait, are they still Bug types?"`I unfused my <UNFUSED_POKEMON>. Now my swarm will show you how great Bug-type Pokémon are!"{I won't stop discovering as many species of Bug-type Pokémon as I can. That's why I reversed my <UNREVERSED_POKEMON>!"[I can tell you also love Bug-type Pokémon. Take this, from one Bug Maniac to another."@Listen, could I get you to battle the Pokémon I'm raising?"EI'm going to redouble my training. Would you come look in on us?"uI always have such a hard time choosing which Pokémon to train. I couldn't help myself and took on another one!"cMy <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved, and it's all thanks to the battles you've been having with me!"ZI fused <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> so that I could train both of them at once!"m<UNFUSED_POKEMON> has been a handful, so I unfused it so I can deal with all of its needs one at a time."�I wanted to catch new Pokémon, but I don't have much room for more of them. That's why I reversed my <UNREVERSED_POKEMON>'s fusion instead."�My Pokémon woke me up early this morning and gave me this. I'm guessing they wanted you to have it as thanks for helping them grow."LThe aroma of flowers has a magical power. It cleanses us body and soul."qI still believe that the aroma of flowers has a magical power. That's why I use scented oils on my Pokémon!"~<CAUGHT_POKEMON> came over to me after smelling the aroma I was wearing. This is proof that flower aroma has magic power!"�My <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved! If I figure out what combination of oils I put on it, maybe I can sell that as an Evolution fragrance!"vSniff... That odor- It's a Pokédex! Are you trying to find new species? You must see this Pokémon I just fused!"�I don't think my <UNFUSED_POKEMON> liked the fragrance I was using... It unfused and the two Pokémon ran off in different directions! I managed to get them to come back, though."�My Pokémon has absorbed all kinds of beautiful scents since it reversed to the opposite fusion species. Perhaps <REVERSED_POKEMON> are especially potent with flower power!"�I tried putting flower-scented oils on this, but something went wrong. It's giving me a sinus headache, so please take it. Maybe it will help you instead."=I can understand what Pokémon say! Look, I'll prove it!"PYour Pokémon said you're good at making them stronger! Let's battle again!"i<CAUGHT_POKEMON> said it was lonely, so I offered to be its friend. What's with that skeptical look?"�<EVOLVED_POKEMON> doesn't say the same things that it said when it was <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON>. Hey, do you think I'm making this up?"iMy Pokémon asked to be fused together. I wonder why they'd want that. No, it wasn't my idea at all!"�Sometimes I have a hard time understanding what my fused Pokémon say, so I unfused my <UNFUSED_POKEMON>. I'm not just making excuses!"�I thought that <REVERSED_POKEMON> would be the same as it was before reversing, but it talks like it has a different personality! I'm not lying! I never lie!"�You at least believe me a little when I say I can understand Pokémon, right? Even if you don't, I think your Pokémon believes me, so please give it this."qFor fishermen, equipment is key.<br>But for Trainers, the key ingredients are Pokémon and heart, of course!"]It's wonderful to see Pokémon that are raised with so much heart. Can I see them again?"tI caught this <CAUGHT_POKEMON>, but it doesn't really trust me yet. Loving relationships of any kind take time."2I'm so proud! My <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved!"|It's up to a Trainer to decide when to use a DNA Splicer. Make sure you always have your Pokémon's best interests at heart."�Ever since I unfused my <UNFUSED_POKEMON>, my <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> help by holding my fishing equipment while I work. They're so kind!"�My Pokémon changed, and I'm still getting used to it. I'm trying to be understanding, but maybe you can show me how through a battle?"�Remember! Strength isn't what makes a great Trainer. If you're bad at battling but you love your Pokémon, that makes you a winner!<br>Remember that when you use this!">I quit Team Rocket and came to Hoenn to start a new life!"�Are you telling me that the winner of a Pokémon battle isn't actually supposed to take the loser's Pokémon? Wait, let's try this again!"_My new <CAUGHT_POKEMON> and I are gonna play you a rockin' tune!<br>No, I didn't steal it!"UDid my Pokémon really evolve? This kind of thing never happened in Team Rocket!"�My <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> came together to make something new. Just like how this ex-grunt and music came together to rock you!"eI almost tried to steal from someone again, but my Pokémon unfused so they could gang up on me!"nMy <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> reversed and totally changed. Just like my Pokémon, I can sing a different tune!"~You treated me as Dalton the Rocker rather than some nameless grunt. I want you to have this. I got it from... somewhere."MWith my electric Pokémon, I'll shatter your dreams whole, whoa-yeahaha!"NMy voice needs a warm up, and my Pokémon are ready to go, want to fight?"MThis Pokémon was drawn in by my music, and now wants to battle! Oh-yea!"{The vocal and battle warm-ups we have been doing made <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> Evolve!<br>Want to see what it's capable of?"i<HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> duet potential is just too good to leave them unfused! Yeaa-ah-ah!"Z<HEAD_POKEMON> is at it's best as a solo, <BODY_POKEMON> was only bringing them down!"xSometimes you need a sharp change of tune in a song, I think it's time to reverse <UNREVERSED_POKEMON>! Oh-oh-Yeaa!"^Thanks a lot for letting me test out my performance, here's something for my biggest fan!"�I heard about this thing called a fuse box, but my mom won't let me near it!<br>If I beat you, you gotta let me use yours to make stronger fusions!"�I asked my teacher what a fuse box does, but they keep telling me it would "shock me".<br>I'm a big kid, I can handle the suprise. I swear! Just tell me what it does!"eI heard that you could find a fuse box in basements, but instead I found a wild Pokémon. Weird!"wWhen my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved, its power made up some crazy wind!<br>Is this what it means to "blow a fuse"?"kI fused my <FUSED_POKEMON> just like a fuse box would!<br>Huh? You're saying it doesn't do that? Liar!"fI unfused my Pokémon, so I can use a fuse box. After all, you can't fuse already fused Pokémon!"xI thought I had finally gotten my hands on a fuse box, and I used it!<br>...But it was just a DNA Reverser, phooey!"uI have a gift for you that you can't "re-fuse"<br>Huh? It's pronounced "refuse"? Oh, whatever - just take this!."BWith my charm and my Pokémon's power, you'll end up shocked!"rMy charm doesn't need improvement, but I'm sure my Pokémon may use some battle experience.<br>Let's rematch!"dMy charms just got me a new Pokémon, I knew I still got it!<br>Let's check out how good it is!"pI was shocked when I found my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> has evolved!<br>What did it evolve into? Let me show you!"�Fusing my charm and my Pokémon's power is not enough, so I'm going to fuse <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON>. Want to see the results?"mI wasn't electrified about <UNFUSED_POKEMON>'s ability in battle... Maybe unfusing it is for the better?"rI just realized my Pokémon's shock potential will be even better if reversed! Do you want to try it with me?"OI did say my charm is a big asset of mine, didn't I? Here, have this gift!"EI have the ultimate strategy. This combo is unbeatable together."9I think I know a new strategy.<br>I hope this works!"VI gener- I mean, caught a new Pokemon. <br>Lemme see if this one is strong enough"wI got some Rare Candies and my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved<br>Yes- they are legit... <br>Look, let us just battle."EI changed my team a bit like that one Pokemon Champion guy does!"QI needed to reorganize my team a little bit, so I had to unfuse some things."mI found out I had one of those Reverser thingies in my bag, so I used that to make my team more dynamic."bI got this item that fell out of favor, and I do not want it anymore. <br>So here, take this."{There is only one thing you need to know about me, and that is that there is only one thing you need to know about me."jYou already know everything there is to know about me.<br>All I can offer you now is another rematch."DThere is something new to know about me! I have a new Pokémon!"FMy <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> has evolved, and I decided to follow suit!"TI was overwhelmed with my number of Pokémon, so I fused some of them together."LLet me tell you everything there is to know about my <UNFUSED_POKEMON>!"ZReversing your Pokémon can have huge consequences, so really think it through first!"JI want to give this to you, so that a piece of me is always with you."FI swell with optimism, seeing a promising young Trainer like you!"A <CAUGHT_POKEMON> wandered in here and got stuck because of the door traps, poor thing. I designed my gym for youthful Trainers like you, not wild Pokémon!<br>Well, you don't need to worry about the Pokémon. It's not wild anymore, if you know what I mean!"�Shocking! Electrifying! Wahahahah! My <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> just evolved!<br>It fills me with energy, watching my Pokémon grow up alongside the Trainers that battle here!"�Fusing Pokémon is a little bit like engineering. You decide which parts are best for each other, and then you combine them to create something electrifying! Wahahahah!"�My Pokémon help me with repairing the traps in my Gym. <UNFUSED_POKEMON> unfused to help with two different rigged doors at once, so don't be surprised if you see a <BODY_POKEMON> or a <HEAD_POKEMON> running around!"]Our batteries ran dry, so to speak. I reversed <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> to change things up!"�Wahahahah! All right, youngster, you've got my approval! I look forward to more big things from you in the future! Now, take this!"RIf you want to save money on your camping trip, follow this one simple trick!"<I'm thinking about more ways to go camping on a budget."sI caught this <CAUGHT_POKEMON> when it was sneaking up on my tent!<br>Always stay alert when sleeping outside!"KMy <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved!<br>Now it can carry more stuff for me!"rHave you heard of a spork? It's a fusion between a spoon and a fork! It's kind of like my Pokémon, in a way."UMy spork broke! Now it's back to being a spoon and a fork... Like my Pokémon..."+Look! I turned my spork into a foroon!"mWhen traveling on a budget, you don't want to carry anything you don't need.<br>Here, you can have this."2Something smells nice here. Oh wait, it's me!"sWhat even is an Aromalady, you ask?<br> Let me give you another demonstration, maybe then you will understand!"YA <CAUGHT_POKEMON> was attracted to my smell and now it won't leave my side anymore."BWhen I put on my new perfume, my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved."bToday I tried putting on two perfumes at the same time.<br>The combined smell is mesmerizing.":Even with no perfume at all, I still smell very nice."VI have a cold today and I can't smell well.<br>Please tell me I still smell nice?"`Would you buy my perfume?<br>It's not on sale yet, but here is a bonus for early customers."JMunch, munch. I'm just here eating a sandwich. We should battle, too."5Munch, munch, munch. Hm? Did you want something?"mI have a tendency to drop food out of my sandwich when I walk. It led this <CAUGHT_POKEMON> right to me!"`I gave my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> a sandwich, and then it evolved! What're in these sandwiches?"�I took a sip of my tea before having a bite of my sandwich, and that made it even tastier!<br>Wait, that gives me an idea! Let me use this DNA Splicer before we do anything!"�Ugh, there's onions in my sandwich. I've got to take it apart to improve it.<br>Wait, that gives me an idea! Let me use this DNA Splicer first!"�What's the reverse of a sandwich? It's a chiwdnas! No, that's not right. It's a salad? Uhhh, well, the reverse of my <UNREVERSED_POKEMON> is a <REVERSED_POKEMON>!"�I stand here and eat a sandwich every day. You see some crazy stuff that way.<br>Here, this went flying past me once. Since it didn't land in my sandwich, you can have it."VHave you seen my sandwich? I must have dropped it somewhere and now I'm starving!"ZJust who keeps stealing all of my snacks?!<br>Do you think a Pokémon is behind this?"oI thought this <CAUGHT_POKEMON> was behind the disappearance of my snacks.<br>But no, they keep vanishing."�I found some slices of onion on the ground, but I decided to feed them to my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> instead.<br>You won't believe what happened next!"�There wasn't enough food left to feed all of my Pokémon, so I had to reduce the number of mouths to feed... <br>Don't worry, I just fused two of my Pokémon!"MMy <UNFUSED_POKEMON> was so hungry that it tried to eat a DNA Splicer..."TMy stomach is so empty, it's about to underflow and turn into a positive value."DPlease, just give me something to eat! I'll even give you this!"�When I was a kid, I was playing video games in which I would climb volcanoes, but you are actually doing it in real life right now!<br>Alright, the camera is on!<br>We have to make a report about this!"�We are filming a report about the recent influx of teenagers climbing that volcano unsupervised!<br>Okay, roll the camera!<br>Let's get this interview!"#That's the spirit! I like you!"WYou've come for another battle? Well maybe this one will be my "Victor"-y, heh he!"sHoly leaping Linoones in the land of Littleroot! I caught a new Pokémon, and now it's time to battle with it!"tGreat day in the morning! I guess I've gotten a bit stronger!<br>I must have if my <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved!"�Well would you look at that! I used and DNA Splicer and now my Pokémon is combined like a troubling thicket of Tangelas on a Tuesday evening!"�When I was your age, all this "fusion" stuff wasn't a thing.<br>It's for sure great and all, but I like to unfuse sometimes for the nostalgia..."�My boy makes me proud, he's off on his own journey carving his own path like a Sandslash through soil!<br>Doesn't mean I can't try to improve myself!! Go, DNA Reverser!!"xThat was a good battle! Shame I lost again, though.<br>A victory like that deserves a prize, so here this is yours!"{Oh, my goodness! Aren't you young?<br>You must be quite the Trainer to beat my husband, though. It's my turn to battle now!"cIt's nice of you to visit again for another battle, dearie~<br>I'll be sure to give it my all!"�With my son gone, I've got that "empty nest syndrome".Soooooo....<br>I caught a new Pokémon for myself to help fix that feeling! Let's show them what for, <CAUGHT_POKEMON>!"nMy little cutie of a <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved! I guess I can't really call it little anymore though..."�I'm happy I get to battle as much as I do at this age still! Yet sometimes all this fusion stuff, well....<br>It reminds me of our honeymoon..."�My <UNFUSED_POKEMON> was being a bit bratty, so I had to put them in "timeout" for a bit by unfusing them.<br>Hopefully this battle will help clear their minds!"�I try to keep my home nice and full of "feng shui". I try to do same with my Pokémon as well, but it hasn't felt right....<br>Maybe reversing a fusion on my team will fix that feeling right up!"lOur son is off on his own journey, makes a mother worry...<br>You remind me a lot of him, so take this."OYou're stronger than Mommy?<br>Wow! But I'm strong, too! Really! Honestly!"sYou've come for another battle? Great!<br>If we keep battling, eventually I'll be a strong as my brother Vito!"WI caught another Pokémon!<br>I'm one step closer to being the best in the family!"�Hey! Did you know?<br>Did you know that my Pokémon have gotten stronger and evolved since last time we've battled?<br>Now you know!"�I called my brother and asked him for some advice. He recommended fusing my <HEAD_POKEMON> and <BODY_POKEMON> together!<br>Let's see if he was right!"}A good trainer knows when to take a step back and restrategize their team.<br>That's why I unfused my <UNFUSED_POKEMON>!"�I wanted to mix things up, so I used a DNA Reverser. My dad could learn a thing or two from that.<br>I'm getting sidetracked, let's battle!"fI lost ag-gain, sniffle... B-but I'll keep improving, so thanks!<br>I think you should have this!"bHow dare you make my granddaughter cry!<br>For that, I'm going to smack you! Prepare to lose!"XI haven't forgiven you for making my granddaughter cry!<br>I'll beat you senseless!"RThis 97-year-old granny can still catch Pokémon the old-fashioned way! Hwah!"rMy <UNEVOLVED_POKEMON> evolved, and let me tell you.<br>My son could learn a' thing or two from that, Keh he!"�When fusing Pokémon, some think about power of looks...<br>But that's all nonsense! I just wanted an excuse to spoil 'em! Kwah ha!"�I taught my grandson nearly everything he knows about battling!<br>So you shouldn't be surprised that I know when to unfuse my Pokémon either!"dThese old eyes of mine... I had meant to use a splicer, but instead I used a Reverser. Oh well!"oKeh he he! You've been spending a lot more time with us Winstrates that you'd have to!<br>Here, take this.Iu;␀�F[[)"I AM STRONG AREN'T I ?"A WIN IS JUST AWESOME"HAHAHA ! SEE YA LATER !"!IT'S SAD TO SEE YOU STRUGGLE"&IT'S INCREDIBLE HOW STRONG I AM !"HAHAHA !! I AM LOLLING !"YOU DON'T STUDY ENOUGH ..."YOU'RE DONE AREN'T YOU ?"COOL ! THAT'S WHAT I AM" THERE IS NO SURRENDER IN ME"I WIN ! FATHER I'VE WON"#THANK YOU !! THANK YOU SO MUCH"NATURALLY I WIN"!I WILL HAVE A POKéMON PARTY"I LIKE MYSELF WHEN I WIN !",HERE IT IS YOUR SWEET KISS FROM MY JYNX"%POKéMON NEVER GO OUT OF FASHION"LIFE IS ALWAYS GOOD TO ME"I AM READY TO GO ON !" IT'S ME WHO IS REALLY TOUGH"WAS THAT ENOUGH FOR YOU ?"#MY HAPPINESS IS OVERWHELMING !"%YUP I AM CUTE AND AWFULLY STRONG"I SAID I WAS OLD BUT GOOD"YEAH ! I AM OFF TO SURF"#THAT WAS YOUR GOOD STRATEGY ?!"I AM NEW BUT I WON !"I AM