 your brakes are perfectly fine? Had me worried for nothing..."$My brakes are totally worn out!"%I should have used third gear..."KOnce I have unlocked the fifth gear, I will win! That will be my peak!"Woah! My brakes failed!",It's a good thing I'm wearing a helmet!"1Very good! Looks like it's fully waterproof!",Oh yeah, they're strong enough alright!"Why are you so serious?"(I lost while I was lost in thought!"And now I've lost..."!Don't shine it on me though!"!It's so dark! Where are you?"JI don't waste any time being angry over a loss. I would rather train." You broke my concentration!"!Oh, that's quite impressive!"6I wish I could say that losing was a new sight..."GI wanted to write you into my novel, but this loss is embarassing!"@How am I supposed to write my novel under these conditions?"This is boring..."DThis is humiliating! You have to give me a chance to try again!":I was having a field day, but you took home the gold!"EWhat fighting spirit! You ought to be awarded a Challenge Bonus!"<One day my little ones will grow just as strong as you!"Still a long way to go...".I need to get more practices in, I guess."I sped my way to a loss!"Uh... Bug types?"$I still love Bug-type Pokémon!"$You've raised yours superbly..."JI hope one day my Pokémon can be as healthy and strong as your team!"(Quick! I need to heal my Pokémon!!"&Oh, dear me. I seem to have lost.")Maybe I was using the wrong aroma..."%Come in, Pokémon! Are you okay?"Nobody believes me..."I was beaten in heart?"8I think I was beaten in both Pokémon and in heart!"LYou won... I guess you'll take my Pokémon now. Huh? You don't do that?"(At least I get to keep my Pokémon!""Argh! My sneak attack failed!"(So much for trying to be sneaky...!"Woohoo!!",Was my microphone off the whole battle?"&This time my guitar was off-tune!"-I only lost because you have a fuse box!"1I'd keep winning if I had what you had, too!"I was the one shocked!"It's not shocking anymore!"OWait a second... <br> How did my Pok