{1}"+And the correct answer was...\wtnp[10]"&That's a correct answer!\wtnp[10]"SYou're awarded {1} points for your answer. Your current score is {2}.\wtnp[20]"5Unfortunately, that was a wrong answer.\wtnp[10]"2But you'll get another chance at it!\wtnp[15]"DThat's {1} correct answers in a row. You're on a roll!\wtnp[20]"FThat's {1} correct answers in a row. You're doing great!\wtnp[20]"?Here's {1} extra points for maintaining a streak!\wtnp[15]"Is this your final answer?"Type with your keyboard"/Woah! A Pokémon jumped out of the flower!"$It's a flower with pink nectar."){1} picked some of the pink flowers."#It's a flower with red nectar."({1} picked some of the red flowers."$It's a flower with blue nectar."){1} picked some of the blue flowers."&It's a flower with yellow nectar."Show it to a Pokémon?"%{1} flipped the seashell over..."...There's nothing there."EWhat do you think? Do you think any of these have any potential?"Not really..."5It's a vending machine. What do you want to buy?"Purchase anything else?"�Sootopolis Void attacked the city and tried to steal a precious package from the Rangers headquarters. Littleroot Crimson was able to stop him, but now he's coming back with a vengeance..."zThere was a part where Littleroot Crimson had a rematch with Fallarbor Bordeaux and he finally evolved his Combusken."�There was an entire subplot about Rustboro Ivory entering a berry-growing contest that she ended up winning with a super-mutant berry."There was a part where Lilicove Viridian waited until the wind picked up to catch a Pidgeot that had been terrorizing the town."jAt one point, Mauville Yellow met a scientist in the woods and helped him collect highly toxic spore."kLittleroot Crimson seeked out the help of the grandmaster that was hiding at the end of the dark cave."IRustboro Ivory befriended that lonely Oricorio in the flowers field."'The Oricorio kept switching forms!"�Mauville Yellow fused a Pellipper with Exploud to create a sonic weapon. And then it ended up being much too loud, it was so funny!"IPacifidlog Cobalt found that shiny Azumarill. I never saw it coming!"{At least, Littleroot Crimson finally delivered that precious package. I can't wait to see what happens next with that."UHey, that part where Fallarbor Bordeaux fished up that Dragalge was pretty neat."bThat whole subplot about Pacifidlog Cobalt trying to get a tan definitely dragged on a bit..."nAlthough that scene with Lilicove Viridian beating up all the bad guys in the beach house was really fun!"sThe chase sequence with the Kingler when Mauville Yellow was carrying that beach ball was really funny though!"UI never expected Littleroot Crimson to infiltrate the villains's lair like that!"+You need to allow at least one sprite!"1This sprite will remain the displayed sprite"0This sprite is already the displayed sprite"9This is the only sprite available for this Pokémon!"7Eevee is getting tired. You should head back soon!"Main Quests"Hotel Quests"Field Quests"Team Rocket Quests"Legendary Quests"\C[3]NEW MAIN OBJECTIVE: \"\C[{1}]{2} MISSION:"\C[6]NEW QUEST:")\C[3]Main quest completed:\n\C[6]{1}"\C[6]Quest completed!"$\qp\C[6]Obtained 1 Quest Point!"Accepted quests: \C[1]{1}"Completed quests: \C[1]{1}"In-progress: \C[1]{1}"$Also, there's one more thing..."IAs a gift for having helped so many people, I want to give you this."MI have no more rewards to give you! Thanks for helping all these people!";Help {1} more person and I'll give you something good!";Help {1} more people and I'll give you something good!"eThis HM will allow you to illuminate dark caves and should help you to progress in your journey!"mThis item will allows you to get twice the money in a battle if the Pokémon holding it took part in it!"]This will allow you to illuminate caves without having to use a HM! Practical, isn't it?"}This strange cable triggers the evolution of Pokémon that typically evolve via trade. I know you'll put it to good use!"cThis handy item will allow you to sleep anywhere you want. You won't even need hotels anymore!"kThis rare stone can evolve any Pokémon, regardless of their level or evolution method. Use it wisely!"tThis mysterious ball is rumored to be the key to call upon the protector of Ilex Forest. It's a precious relic.";This rare ball can catch any Pokémon. Don't waste it!"[This doubles the money you get in Pokémon battles. Maybe it'll help finance the show!"RThe note that came with it said that it allows you to hatch an egg instantly!"rThere's a note with it. If there's a hidden item anywhere near you, that little thing will react to tell you."�Looks like they sent even more of these incubators for hatching Eggs. There must be a high-profile Pokémon breeder that's a fan of the show!"�There's a note with it. This deluxe sleeping bag will allow you to sleep anywhere you want. It's so comfortable that you can sleep in it for hours!"�Apparently, this strange cable triggers the evolution of Pokémon that typically evolve via trade. I know you'll put it to good use!"{1}'s {2}"Johto Pokémon"^A traveler in the Poké Mart wants you to show him a Pokémon native to the Johto region."Cerulean City"Hoenn Pokémon"XA traveler in the Poké Mart you to show him a Pokémon native to the Hoenn region."Vermillion City"Sinnoh Pokémon"fA traveler in the Department Center wants you to show him a Pokémon native to the Sinnoh region."Celadon City"Unova Pokémon"^A traveler in the Poké Mart wants you to show him a Pokémon native to the Unova region."Fuchsia City"Kalos Pokémon"^A traveler in the Poké Mart wants you to show him a Pokémon native to the Kalos region."Saffron City"Alola Pokémon"^A traveler in the Poké Mart wants you to show him a Pokémon native to the Alola region."Cinnabar Island"Mushroom Gathering"eA lady in Pewter City wants you to bring her 3 TinyMushroom from Viridian Forest to make a stew."Pewter City"Lost Medicine"|A youngster in Pewter City needs your help to find a lost Revive. He lost it by sitting on a bench somewhere in Pewter City."Bug Evolution"UA Bug Catcher in Pewter City wants you to show him a fully-evolved Bug Pokémon."Nectar garden"UAn old man wants you to bring differently colored flowers for the city's garden."I Choose You!"pA Pikachu in the Poké Mart has lost its official Pokémon League Hat. Find one and give it to the Pikachu!"Prehistoric Amber!"NMeetup with a scientist in Viridian Forest to look for prehistoric amber."Playing Cupid"�A boy in Cerulean City wants you bring a love letter to a Pokémon Breeder named Maude. She's probably somewhere in one of the routes near Cerulean City"Type Experts"ODefeat all of the Type Experts scattered around the Kanto region ({1}/{2})"Field Research (Part 1)"5Professor Oak's aide wants you to catch an Abra."Route 24"Field Research (Part 2)"LProfessor Oak's aide wants you to encounter every Pokémon on Route 24."Field Research (Part 3)"LProfessor Oak's aide wants you to catch a Buneary using the Pokéradar."Fishing for Sole"dA fisherman wants you to fish up an old boot. Hook it up with the old rod in any body of water."Unusual Types 1"JA woman at the hotel wants you to show her a Water/Fire-type Pokémon"Seafood Cocktail"tGet some steamed Krabby legs from the S.S. Anne's kitchen and bring them back to the hotel before they get cold"Building Materials"PGet some wooden planks from Viridian City and some Bricks from Pewter City."Waiter on the Water"fThe S.S. Anne waiter wants you to take restaurant orders while he went to get a replacement cake."S.S. Anne"Sun or Moon"vShow the Pokémon that Eevee evolves when exposed to a Moon or Sun stone to help the scientist with her research."For Whom the Bell Tolls"KRing Lavender Town's bell when the time is right to reveal its secret."Lavender Town"Hardboiled"=A lady wants you to give her an egg to make an omelette."A stroll with Eevee!"7Walk Eevee around for a while until it gets tired."Bicycle Race!"YGo meet the Cyclist at the bottom of Route 17 and beat her time up the Cycling Road!"Cycling Road"Lost Pokémon!"%Find the lost Chansey's trainer!"!Cleaning up the Cycling Road">Get rid of all the Pokémon dirtying up the Cycling Road."Bitey Pokémon"iA fisherman wants to know what is the sharp-toothed Pokémon that bit him in the Safari Zone's lake."Shellfish Rescue"SPut all the stranded Shellders back in the water on the route to Crimson City."Crimson City"Fourth Round Rumble"GDefeat Jeanette and her high-level Bellsprout in a Pokémon Battle"Unusual Types 2"LA woman at the hotel wants you to show her a Normal/Ghost-type Pokémon"The Top of the Waterfall"QSomeone wants you to go investigate the top of a waterfall near Crimson City"Lost Puppies"IFind all of the missing Growlithe in the routes around Saffron City."Invisible Pokémon"DFind an invisible Pokémon in the eastern part of Saffron City."Bad to the Bone!"'Find a Rare Bone using Rock Smash."Dancing Queen!"!Dance with the Copycat Girl!"Saffron City (nightclub)" The transformation Pokémon"}The scientist wants you to find some Quick Powder that can sometimes be found with wild Ditto in the mansion's basement."Diamonds and Pearls"8Find a Diamond Necklace to save the man's marriage."Stolen artifact"ARecover a stolen vase from a burglar in the Pokémon Mansion"Safari Souvenir!"<Bring back a souvenir from the Fuchsia City Safari Zone"Goldenrod City"The Cursed Forest"eA child wants you to find a floating tree stump in Ilex Forest. What could she be talking about?"Undercover police work!"YGo see the police in Goldenrod City to help them with an important police operation."Pinkan Island!"fTeam Rocket is planning a heist on Pinkan Island. You joined forces with the police to stop them!"Defuse the Pinecones!"7Get rid of all the Pineco on Route 31 and Route 30"Violet City"Find Slowpoke's Tail!"GFind a SlowpokeTail in some flowers, somewhere around Violet City!"Dragon Evolution"]A Dragon Tamer in Blackthorn City wants you to show her a fully-evolved Dragon Pokémon."Blackthorn City"Sunken Treasure!"CFind an old memorabilia on a sunken ship near Cinnabar Island."The Largest Carp"aA fisherman wants you to fish up a Magikarp that's exceptionally high-level at Dragon's Den."Ghost Evolution"RA girl in Ecruteak City wants you to show her a fully-evolved Ghost Pokémon."Ecruteak City"Banana Slamma!"Collect 30 bananas"Kin Island"Fallen Meteor"+Investigate a crater near Bond Bridge."The rarest fish"vA fisherman wants you to show him a Feebas. Apparently they can be fished around the Sevii Islands when it rains."First Contact"8Find the missing pieces of a fallen alien spaceship"Bond Bridge"First Contact (Part 2)"yAsk the sailor at Cinnabar Island's harbour to take you to the uncharted island where the spaceship might be located"Mysterious prisms"`You found a pedestal with a mysterious prism on it. There seems to be room for more prisms."Pokémon Tower"The long night (Part 1)"A mysterious darkness has shrouded some of the region. Meet Sabrina outside of Saffron City's western gate to investigate."The long night (Part 2)"�The mysterious darkness has expended. Meet Sabrina on top of Celadon City's Dept. Store to figure out the source of the darkness."Route 7"The long night (Part 3)"wFuchsia City appears to be unaffected by the darkness. Go investigate to see if you can find out more information."The long night (Part 4)"The mysterious darkness has expended yet again and strange plants have appeared. Follow the plants to see where they lead."The long night (Part 5)"You found a strange fruit that appears to be related to the mysterious darkness. Go see professor Oak to have it analyzed."Safari Zone"The long night (Part 6)"�The strange plant you found appears to glow in the mysterious darkness that now covers the entire region. Try to follow the glow to find out the source of the disturbance."Pallet Town"A legendary band (Part 1)"�The singer of a band in Saffron City wants you to help them recruit a drummer. They think they've heard some drumming around Crimson City..."A legendary band (Part 2)"�The drummer from a legendary Pokéband wants you to find its former bandmates. The band manager talked about two former guitarists..."A legendary band (Part 3)"�The drummer from a legendary Pokéband wants you to find its former bandmates. There are rumors about strange music that was heard around the region."A legendary band (Part 4)"HYou assembled the full band! Come watch the show on Saturday night."Mysterious Lunar feathers"�A mysterious entity asked you to collect Lunar Feathers for them. It said that they will come at night to tell you where to look. Whoever that may be..."Visit Dad!"4Go visit your Dad at his Gym in Petalburg Town!"Petalburg City"Catching Tutoring"%Catch a wild Pokémon for Wally."The Pokémon Gym Challenge"GChallenge Roxanne in Rustboro City to obtain your first Gym Badge."Rustboro City"FChallenge Brawly in Dewford Town to obtain your second Gym Badge."Dewford Town"GChallenge Wattson in Mauville City to obtain your third Gym Badge."Mauville City"JChallenge Flannery in Lavaridge Town to obtain your fourth Gym Badge."Lavaridge Town"GChallenge Norman in Petalburg City to obtain your fifth Gym Badge."Petalburg Town"EChallenge Winona in Fortree City to obtain your sixth Gym Badge."Fortree City"MChallenge Tate & Liza in Mossdeep City to obtain your seventh Gym Badge."Mossdeep City"IChallenge Wallace in Sootopolis City to obtain your final Gym Badge."Sootopolis City""The Pokémon League Challenge"CCollect all 8 Gym Badges and take part in the Pokémon League!"
Hoenn"Stolen Package",Recover a package stolen by Team Magma!"Steven's Letter"ODeliver a letter from the Devon Corp. president to Steven in Granite Cave."Granite Cave"Devon Parts Delivery"?Deliver the Devon Parts to the Shipyard in Slateport City."Slateport City"Template Quest"@Don't forget to change the quest ID if you copy paste this!"Trainer Rematches"DA lass you battled wants to switch up her team and rematch you!"Route 102"Berry Contest">Take part in the berry-growing contest in Petalburg Town!"Lost glasses":A trainer has lost their glasses, help him find them!"Route 116"Weather Watch"ZHelp your rival with fieldwork and find a Pokémon that only appears when it's windy!"Route 104"Spores Harvest"sA scientist has tasked you to collect 4 spore samples from the large mushrooms that can be found in the woods!"Petalburg Woods"Special Flowery Grass"BFind an Oricorio in the flowery grass behind the flower shop."Nectar Flowers">Find all 4 types of nectar flowers to transform Oricorio."The Allergic Rich Boy"\An allergy-ridden rich boy is looking for a flowery Pokémon to give to his girlfriend."Your Very Own Secret Base!"GTalk to Aarune near his secret base to learn how to make your own."Route 115"Volume Booster!"=Find a Wingull to fuse with a Whismur to make it louder."A Green Marill?"YA child claims they've seen a green Marill by the pond on Route 104. Go investigate!"Clean Up the Beach!"HHelp the ranger clean-up the beach behind the Devon Corp. building."Wild Fusion Study"eHelp a scientist gather data by getting wild Pokémon to fuse before a battle 3 different times."!The Angler's Rite of Passage"qIt's tradition to fish a Skrelp in Dewford Town as a rite of passage. Find one and show it to the fisherman!"Join Team Aqua!"YArchie invited you to join Team Aqua. Go meet them at their camp on Slateport Beach."Join Team Magma!"ZMaxie invited you to join Team Magma. Go meet them at their camp, North of Slateport."Soaking in the sun"8Sit in a beach chair until your suntan is on point!"Route 109"&Hot Battles at the Seashore House"6Defeat all of the trainers in the Seashore House!"Find a New Beach Ball!"CReplace the popped beach ball of the kids playing on the beach"Under Attack!"2Defend the Team Magma Camp against Team Aqua!"Magma Camp"Egg Hunt!"&Collect Slugma Eggs with Tabitha."Cliffside Sanctuary"Grunt work!"GHelp 3 grunts in the Team Magma Camp, then report back to Tabitha!"Anti-Water Training!"8Fuse Numel to make it resistant Water-type attacks."Painting the Town Red"uTeam Aqua painted their logo on various walls in Slateport City. Cover them up with the Team Magma logo instead!"The Magma Theme Song"?Help compose lyrics to the official Team Magma theme song!"2Defend the Team Aqua Camp against Team Magma!"Aqua Camp"%Collect Wailmer Eggs for Shelly."Route 108"EHelp 3 grunts in the Team Aqua Camp, then report back to Shelly!"^You were given two Zubats and a Geodude. Fuse all three of them into Water-type Pokémon."Painting the Town Blue"uTeam Magma painted their logo on various walls in Slateport City. Cover them up with the Team Aqua logo instead!"The Aqua Theme Song">Help compose lyrics to the official Team Aqua theme song!"Cycling Road Time Trial"_Go through the Cycling Road as fast as possible. You'll be penalized if you hit the walls!"Route 110"$Associate Producer! - Episode 1"|You've been hired as an associate producer on a TV show! Complete 2 quests to help write the second season of the show."Mauville TV"$Associate Producer! - Episode 2"|You've been hired as an associate producer on a TV show! Complete 5 quests to help write the second season of the show."$Associate Producer! - Episode 3"}You've been hired as an associate producer on a TV show! Complete 10 quests to help write the second season of the show."$Associate Producer! - Episode 4"}You've been hired as an associate producer on a TV show! Complete 15 quests to help write the second season of the show."$Associate Producer! - Episode 5"}You've been hired as an associate producer on a TV show! Complete 20 quests to help write the second season of the show."$Associate Producer! - Episode 6"}You've been hired as an associate producer on a TV show! Complete 25 quests to help write the second season of the show."$Associate Producer! - Episode 7"}You've been hired as an associate producer on a TV show! Complete 30 quests to help write the second season of the show."The Element of Surprise!"SCatch a Tynamo in the waters near New Mauville to catch Team Aqua by surprise."TCatch a Tynamo in the waters near New Mauville to catch Team Magma by surprise."The Winstrate Family"JDefeat all 4 members of the Winstrate family in back-to-back battles."Route 111"A Lost Shroomish">A girl lost her Shroomish and needs your help to find it."Verdanturf Town"The Bored Nurse"oThe Pokémon Center's nurse challenged you to a battle. Meet her in the meadow behind the Pokémon Center."Uproar in B Flat"LA trumpet player is cornered in Rusturf Tunnel. Find a way to help him!"Rusturf Tunnel"The Trumpet Festival!"QFind the 4 Trumpet Brothers and join the Trumpet Festival in Evergrande City"Evergrande City"No completed quests"No ongoing main quests"No side quests"No quests in {1}"Quest Log"L/R : MAP"Completed"Not Completed"\C[{1}]NEW MISSION:"Creepy Crawlies"yThe Team Rocket Captain has tasked you with clearing the bug infestation in the temporary Rocket HQ in Cerulean City"No Fishing Zone"IIntimidate the fishermen at Nugget Bridge until they leave the area."Disobedient Pokémon"[Bring back the Pokémon given by the Team Rocket Captain fainted to teach it a lesson."Gran Theft Pokémon!"BFollow Petrel and go steal a rare Pokémon from a young girl."Supplying the new grunts"ICatch 4 Pokémon with Rocket Balls in the outskirts of Celadon City."Interception!"iIntercept the TMs shipment to the Celadon Store and pose as the delivery person to deliver fake TMs."Pokémon Collector"\Go meet a Pokémon collector on Route 22, near Viridian City and get his rare Pokémon."Operation Shutdown"aThe Team Rocket HQ is being raided! Regroup with the rest of the grunts in Goldenrod Tunnel!"AHelp Team Rocket with a heist on a Pokémon nature preserve!":First off what does the legendary Pokémon look like?"A flying creature"A large beast"An aquatic creature"I don't know..."6You don't know? Have you even seen that Pokémon?"2Hmm... You better have some more information."Y{1} that's also a legendary Pokémon? That sounds incredible! You have my attention."!Okay... What about its type?"Electric-type"Fire-type"Water-Type"Ice-type")So you don't know its type... Hmm..."5Hmm... So it's an unknown creature that's {1}..."Hmm... {1} that's {2}."!That sounds pretty exciting!"9I've never heard of such a creature, but keep going."5So... Where was this legendary Pokémon sighted?"Near Viridian City"Near Lavender Town"Near Cerulean City"Near Cinnabar Island"I don't know"CDo you even know anything? This has been such a waste of time!"XHow can you not know where it was sighted? Do you know how unhelpful this is to me?"\{1}, huh? Ah yes, that would make a lot of sense... How did I not think of this before?">Hmmm... {1}, really? That sounds pretty surprising to me."Viridian City"that unknown location"SAnd at what time of the day was that legendary Pokémon seen near {1} exactly?"At dawn"At noon"In the afternoon"At sunset"At night"#So it was seen near {1} {2}..."/... Wait, I can't take your only Pokémon!"@Oh, this is the Pokémon you got from the collector, right?"XYeah, I can't take that one. The collector blabbed to the police so it's too risky."/You wanna sell me this {1}, is that right?"Hmm... Let's see..."7\GI could give you ${1} for it. Do we have a deal?"J\GExcellent. And of course, 30% goes to Team Rocket. So you get ${1}."(\GPleasure doing business with you."Stop wasting my time!"\Find the first feather in the northernmost dwelling in the port of exquisite sunsets..."aAmidst a nursery for Pokémon youngsters, the second feather hides, surrounded by innocence."8Find the next one in the inn where water meets rest"UFind the next one inside the lone house in the city at the edge of civilization."GThe final feather lies back in the refuge for orphaned Pokémon..."/Lie in the bed... Bring me the feathers..."Trade {1} away?"�Some sprites appear to be missing from your game.\nWould you like the game to download sprites automatically while playing? (this requires an internet connection)"HData files updated. New sprites will now be downloaded as you play!"lA new spritepack was released. Would you like to let the game update your game's sprites automatically?"Unknown Location"({1}, {2})"Experimental options"Expert mode (beta)"NChanges all of the trainer teams to make them as challenging as possible!"No levels mode"=All Pokémon use their base stats, regardless of levels."Reversed mode"9Inverts the fusions of all the trainers in the game."Classic"Remix Mode"Randomized Mode"Legendary Mode"Expert Mode"'Which mode would you like to play?"Play Classic Mode"�\C[1]Classic\C[0] is the default game mode. All of the player teams and encounters are based on the original games. Every Pokémon is still available."Play Remix Mode"�\C[1]Remix mode\C[0] is a special mode made by some members of the community that changes all of the trainer teams and wild encounters to showcase more Pokémon from the newer generations."Play Randomized Mode"�In \C[1]Randomized mode\C[0] all of the trainers, wild encounters and items can be randomized. You'll get to customize exactly how you want everything to be randomized."Play Legendary Mode"�In \C[1]Legendary mode\C[0], every trainer Pokémon gets fused with a legendary Pokémon. You also start with an egg of every legendary Pokémon in your PC and get a legendary starter."Play Expert Mode"�\C[1]Expert mode\C[0] mode is similar to Classic mode, but it changes all of the trainer teams to make them as challenging as possible. Th