Iu;␀�0[[F"oThis bright red Berry is very spicy and has a provocative flavor. It blooms with delicate, pretty flowers."mThis Berry's thick skin and fruit are very tough and dry tasting. However, every bit of it can be eaten."rBecause of its hollow inside pocket, there isn't a lot to eat. What can be eaten is very sweet and delicious."fIf the leaves grow longer and curlier than average, this Berry will have a somewhat-bitter taste."pThis Berry's peel is hard, but the flesh inside is very juicy. It is distinguished by its bracing sourness."ZIt takes longer to grow than Berries such as Cheri. The smaller Berries taste better."rNature's gifts came together as one in this Berry. It has a wondrous mix of flavors that spread in the mouth."ZThe more this berry absorbs energy from sunlight, the more vividly colorful it grows."pThis Berry's gradual process of storing nutrients beneficial to Pokémon health causes it to mature slowly."[Sitrus came from the same family as Oran. It is larger and smoother tasting than Oran."vThis Berry is oddly shaped, appearing as if someone took a bite out of it. It is packed full of spicy substances."iIt is said that this Berry grew lumps to help Pokémon grip it, allowing propagation farther afield."aThis Berry progressively curves as it grows. The curvier the Berry, the sweeter and tastier."kThis Berry turns bitter toward the stem. The dainty flower it grows from doesn't absorb much sunlight."YThis Berry is very big and sour. The juiciness of the pulp accentuates the sourness."rA small hint of spiciness lingers in the red granules surrounding this Berry. Their centers have a dry taste."fThough this small, delicately skinned Berry is blue in color, it dyes the mouth black when eaten."jBitter, but with a trace of sweetness, the Nanab Berry was the seventh to be discovered in the world."sThe potent mix of bitter and sour in this Berry seems to promote digestion. The flower is white and beautiful."dIt is said that when the sour skin is peeled, this spicy Berry can be crushed to make medicine."^When this sweetly spicy Berry's thick skin is peeled, many pieces of the fruit spill out."eThis Berry can be eaten as is or boiled to obtain an extract that adds a dash of flavor to food."dEven in places of constant rain and high humidity, this Berry's plant grows healthy and strong."[This somewhat-rare Berry projects an image of luxury, so it is favored as a gift item."XOne bite of this very tender Berry fills the mouth with its sweet and tangy flavor."eThis Berry is large and spicy. When eaten during the cold season, it warms the body from inside."uIts dryness is quite strong. As a result, its true deliciousness can't be appreciated by just eating one or two."fThe grown-up flavor and dreamy sweetness of this Berry make it a favorite of Pokémon everywhere."xEven though it is bitter, it should be eaten peel and all. The hair on the peel cleans the stomach from the inside."dThis Berry is quite sour overall, with the sourness especially concentrated at the pointed end."vSo spicy is the Spelon Berry that, Fire type or not, Pokémon will try to breathe fire after eating a single one."VThis Berry drifted from a faraway sea. It is now cultivated in the Sinnoh region."qA bounty of nature that is exceedingly sweet. The Berry is huge, with some discovered that exceed 20 inches."ZThis Berry is tremendously bitter. Just one bite is enough to instantly stop hiccups."lThis glossy and colorful Berry has a mouthwateringly delicious appearance. However, it is awfully sour."qThis Berry is said to have grown plentiful in the tropics of the past. It boasts an intensely hot spiciness."bThis Berry's flesh is dotted with countless tiny bubbles of air that keep it afloat in water."aEnergy from lightning strikes is drawn into the plant, making the Berries grow big and rich."xThis berry has a disagreeable "green" flavor and scent typical of vegetables. It is rich in health-promoting fiber."vThis Berry has a refreshing flavor that strikes a good balance of dryness and sourness. It tastes better chilled."]This Berry contains a substance that generates heat. It can even heat up a chilly heart."sThis Berry is a brilliant green on the outside. Inside, it is packed with a dry-flavored, black-colored flesh."XThe sweetness-laden pulp has just the hint of a hard-edged and fragrant bite to it."pThis Berry is said to be a new kind that is a cross of two Berries brought together by winds from far away."gThis Berry is said to sense human emotions for the way it swells roundly when a person approaches."rThe flower grows at the tip of this Berry. It attracts Bug Pokémon by letting its stringy petals stream out."uIt is often used for pickles because of its very dry flavor. It can also be eaten raw for its provocative taste."yConsidered to have a special power from the olden days, this Berry is sometimes dried and used as a good-luck charm."kIf a large enough volume of this Berry is boiled down, its bitterness fades away. It makes a good jam."tTiny hooks grow on the surface of this Berry. It latches on to Pokémon so it can be carried to far-off places."gThis Berry is very tough with a strong flavor. It was used to make medicine by people in the past."tThis Berry can be cored out and dried to make a whistle. Blowing through its hole makes an indescribable sound."_This Berry is surrounded by mystery. It is rumored to be imbued with the power of the sea."`This Berry is surrounded by mystery. It is rumored to be imbued with the power of the land."_This Berry is surrounded by mystery. It is rumored to be imbued with the power of the sky."iThis Berry is surrounded by mystery. It is rumored to be imbued with the power of all living things."uThis is a very, very mystifying Berry. There is no telling how it can be used, or what may happen if it is used."RThis is said to be a legendary Berry. Holding it supposedly brings great joy."tThis Berry is considered a mirage. It was said to be so strong that it had to be abandoned at the world's edge."dA completely enigmatic Berry. It apparently has the power of the stars that fill the night sky."qThis berry has a very dry flavor. It has the effect of making other food eaten at the same time taste sweet."QThe flesh underneath the Custap Berry's tough skin is sweet and creamy soft."gThe cluster of drupelets that make up this berry pop rhythmically if the berry is handled roughly."bIn days of old, people worked the top-shaped pieces of this Berry free and used them as toys."{The slight bitterness that cuts through the rich sweetness makes this Berry a perfect ingredient for adding an accent.[F"k这种鲜红色的树果非常辛辣，带有挑逗性的风味。它会开出精致美丽的花朵。"n这种树果的厚皮和果肉非常坚韧，口感干涩。然而，它的每一部分都可以食用。"_由于其内部中空，能吃的地方不多。但能吃到的部分非常甜美可口。"V如果叶子长得比平均更长更卷，这种树果的味道会略带苦涩。"k这种树果的果皮坚硬，但内部的果肉非常多汁。它以令人振奋的酸味而著称。"V它比樱子果之类的树果生长时间更长。较小的果实味道更好。"q大自然的恩赐汇聚于这一种树果之中。它具有奇妙混合的风味，在口中弥漫开来。"M这种树果吸收的阳光能量越多，生长得就越鲜艳多彩。"_这种树果逐渐储存有益于宝可梦健康的养分的过程导致其成熟缓慢。"Y橙橙果与文柚果属于同一科。它比文柚果更大，口感也更顺滑。"_这种树果形状奇特，看起来像是被人咬了一口。它充满了辛辣物质。"k据说这种树果长出凸块是为了帮助宝可梦抓握，从而得以传播到更远的地方。"V这种树果在生长过程中逐渐弯曲。果实越弯，就越甜美可口。"\这种树果靠近茎的部分会变苦。它那娇美的花朵吸收的阳光不多。"M这种树果非常大且酸。果肉的多汁性更加突出了酸味。"_围绕这种树果的红色颗粒中残留着一丝辣味。它们的中心口感干涩。"\尽管这种小巧皮薄的树果是蓝色的，但食用时会将嘴巴染成黑色。"_虽然苦涩，但带有一丝甜味的蕉香果是世界上第七种被发现的树果。"b这种树果中苦涩与酸味的强烈混合似乎有助于消化。它的花洁白美丽。"S据说剥去酸味的果皮后，这种辛辣的树果可以被碾碎制药。"P剥开这种甜辣树果的厚皮时，会有许多果肉块散落出来。"b这种树果可以直接食用，也可以煮沸提取精华，为食物增添一抹风味。"h即使在持续降雨和高湿度的环境中，这种树果的植株也能健康茁壮地生长。"e这种略显稀有的树果散发着奢华的气息，因此备受青睐，常被用作礼品。"V咬一口这种非常柔软的树果，口中便充满了香甜浓郁的风味。"_这种树果个头大且辛辣。在寒冷的季节食用时，能从体内温暖身体。"_它的干涩感相当强烈。因此，只吃一两颗是无法领略其真正美味的。"\这种树果成熟的风味和梦幻般的甜味使其成为各地宝可梦的最爱。"\尽管味苦，但应该连皮一起吃。果皮上的绒毛能从内部清洁肠胃。">这种树果整体偏酸，酸味尤其集中在尖端。"t辣茄果是如此辛辣，以至于无论是不是火属性，宝可梦只要吃上一颗就会试图喷火。"S这种树果从遥远的大海漂流而来。现在在神奥地区有栽培。"j大自然慷慨馈赠的极致甘甜。这种树果巨大无比，曾发现超过20英寸的个体。"M这种树果极其苦涩。只需咬一口就足以立刻止住打嗝。"h这种光滑多彩的树果有着令人垂涎欲滴的美味外观。然而，它却酸得要命。"e据说这种树果在过去的热带地区生长繁茂。它以极其强烈的辛辣而自豪。"\这种树果的果肉中密布着无数微小的气泡，使其能够浮在水面上。"G闪电的能量被吸入植株，使树果长得又大又饱满。"p这种树果有一种令人不快的"青草"味和典型的蔬菜气味。它富含促进健康的纤维。"t这种树果具有清爽的风味，在干涩和酸味之间取得了良好的平衡。冷藏后味道更佳。"\这种树果含有一种产生热量的物质。它甚至能温暖一颗冰冷的心。"V这种树果外表呈亮绿色。内部则充满了口感干涩的黑色果肉。"D充满甜味的果肉中带着一丝干脆而芬芳的口感。"\据说这是一种新品种，是由远方吹来的风将两种树果杂交而成的。"b据说这种树果能感知人类的情绪，因为当有人靠近时它会圆圆地鼓起。"n这种树果的顶端生长着花朵。它通过让线状花瓣飘散出去来吸引虫属性宝可梦。"n由于其非常干涩的风味，常被用于腌制泡菜。也可以生吃，享受其刺激的味道。"b自古以来被认为具有特殊力量的这种树果，有时会被晒干用作护身符。"n如果将足量的这种树果熬煮浓缩，其苦味就会消失。可以用来制作美味的果酱。"q这种树果的表面长有细小的钩子。它会钩在宝可梦身上，以便被带到遥远的地方。"M这种树果非常坚韧，味道浓烈。过去人们用它来制药。"h这种树果可以挖空晒干制成哨子。对着它的孔吹气会发出难以形容的声音。"M这种树果笼罩在神秘之中。传闻它蕴含着海洋的力量。"M这种树果笼罩在神秘之中。传闻它蕴含着大地的力量。"M这种树果笼罩在神秘之中。传闻它蕴含着天空的力量。"S这种树果笼罩在神秘之中。传闻它蕴含着所有生命的力量。"q这是一种非常、非常神奇的树果。无从得知如何使用它，或者使用后会发生什么。"V据说这是一种传说中的树果。持有它据说能带来巨大的喜悦。"_这种树果被视为幻影。据说它过于强大，不得不被遗弃在世界边缘。"P一种完全神秘的树果。它显然拥有布满夜空星辰的力量。"h这种树果风味非常干涩。它具有使同时食用的其他食物尝起来变甜的效果。"J奇秘果坚韧果皮下的果肉甜美柔滑，如奶油般柔软。"\构成这种树果的小核果簇，如果粗暴处理，会有节奏地爆裂开来。"V在古代，人们会把这种树果的陀螺形部分分离出来当作玩具。"\贯穿浓郁甜味的一丝微苦，使这种树果成为增添风味的完美食材。;[F"oThis bright red Berry is very spicy and has a provocative flavor. It blooms with delicate, pretty flowers."mThis Berry's thick skin and fruit are very tough and dry tasting. However, every bit of it can be eaten."rBecause of its hollow inside pocket, there isn't a lot to eat. What can be eaten is very sweet and delicious."fIf the leaves grow longer and curlier than average, this Berry will have a somewhat-bitter taste."pThis Berry's peel is hard, but the flesh inside is very juicy. It is distinguished by its bracing sourness."ZIt takes longer to grow than Berries such as Cheri. The smaller Berries taste better."rNature's gifts came together as one in this Berry. It has a wondrous mix of flavors that spread in the mouth."ZThe more this berry absorbs energy from sunlight, the more vividly colorful it grows."pThis Berry's gradual process of storing nutrients beneficial to Pokémon health causes it to mature slowly."[Sitrus came from the same family as Oran. It is larger and smoother tasting than Oran."vThis Berry is oddly shaped, appearing as if someone took a bite out of it. It is packed full of spicy substances."iIt is said that this Berry grew lumps to help Pokémon grip it, allowing propagation farther afield."aThis Berry progressively curves as it grows. The curvier the Berry, the sweeter and tastier."kThis Berry turns bitter toward the stem. The dainty flower it grows from doesn't absorb much sunlight."YThis Berry is very big and sour. The juiciness of the pulp accentuates the sourness."rA small hint of spiciness lingers in the red granules surrounding this Berry. Their centers have a dry taste."fThough this small, delicately skinned Berry is blue in color, it dyes the mouth black when eaten."jBitter, but with a trace of sweetness, the Nanab Berry was the seventh to be discovered in the world."sThe potent mix of bitter and sour in this Berry seems to promote digestion. The flower is white and beautiful."dIt is said that when the sour skin is peeled, this spicy Berry can be crushed to make medicine."^When this sweetly spicy Berry's thick skin is peeled, many pieces of the fruit spill out."eThis Berry can be eaten as is or boiled to obtain an extract that adds a dash of flavor to food."dEven in places of constant rain and high humidity, this Berry's plant grows healthy and strong."[This somewhat-rare Berry projects an image of luxury, so it is favored as a gift item."XOne bite of this very tender Berry fills the mouth with its sweet and tangy flavor."eThis Berry is large and spicy. When eaten during the cold season, it warms the body from inside."uIts dryness is quite strong. As a result, its true deliciousness can't be appreciated by just eating one or two."fThe grown-up flavor and dreamy sweetness of this Berry make it a favorite of Pokémon everywhere."xEven though it is bitter, it should be eaten peel and all. The hair on the peel cleans the stomach from the inside."dThis Berry is quite sour overall, with the sourness especially concentrated at the pointed end."vSo spicy is the Spelon Berry that, Fire type or not, Pokémon will try to breathe fire after eating a single one."VThis Berry drifted from a faraway sea. It is now cultivated in the Sinnoh region."qA bounty of nature that is exceedingly sweet. The Berry is huge, with some discovered that exceed 20 inches."ZThis B